inl note_of_workspace_primitives_lib_2 () = Note ("WORKSPACE-PRIMITIVES-LIB", 2u32, "2026-10-14T22:01Z", "lane-b", "env slice drafted (job tmp lane-b/eoie-staged/environment.spi: env_setting union EnvUnset|EnvSet, env_present, env_text, env_count_or) but not landed: its first user, the inspection_text_limit blob (parallel_search_contract/search_terminal.spi, compiled into eoie_proxy_search/search.rs), is called from other Rust blobs by name, so moving it needs an !!!!Export with a usize signature from proxy_search_entry's main or migrating its callers together; deferred behind today's renewal")
