inl note_of_tree_sitter_spiral_23 () = Note ("TREE-SITTER-SPIRAL", 23u32, "2026-11-02T14:05Z", "x", "2026-11-02 09:59 x: DECISION RECORD (typed; groom of user waits, user 11-02: 'decisions waiting on me get met autonomously/deterministically with tests/benchs/typefeatureset modeling/backups'). kind=ByTest. QUESTION: The user's in-Zed check of the line grammar. RULE (written before acting): The grammar is already committed (apps/zed/tree-sitter-spiral, 14 tracked files), extension.toml [grammars.spiral] is set to rev 3c76d3ed (a valid commit), and config.toml has grammar = spiral (last apps/zed commit fd70dccf 10-30). PASS iff (a) tree-sitter test passes, (b) 0 parse errors over the 583-file corpus plus 1159 samples, (c) runnables.scm captures 375/375 test headers with correct names, and (d) an off-screen, muted Zed launch with the dev extension logs the spiral grammar loading with no grammar/query error in Zed.log. Otherwise reopen with the failing query. BACKUP/UNDO: No source change. Any fix is left unstaged. OWNER: main. NEXT: Run (a)-(d) and close. Drop user-batch and set the assignee to agent. VETO: the user can reverse this at any time; the backup above is the undo.")
