inl note_of_tibia_agent_1 () = Note ("TIBIA-AGENT", 1u32, "2026-11-02T11:25Z", "tibia", "11-02 tibia: the agent drafts were saved out of the gitignored target/predict into the kit drafts store at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\tibia\\TIBIA-AGENT\\. 39 files, 486,479 bytes, all copies hash-verified.\n- m3\\: the full M3 tree, i.e. src at 10-23 plus src\\typed_network.spi (7,794 B, sha256 4250F8110DCC…, the n49 draft: graph size state, raw/planned/frozen, width prototype eight=8/wide=25) and apps\\predict (the M3 harness main).\n- m1\\src\\search.spi: evolve_cem with the i64 elite fix (n32).\n- m2e\\: the 10-23 11:15 patched views/network/hunting_pack/pack_sim/live (sighted, wide_inputs, decide_wide, wide_features) plus apps\\predict.\nWhy the store and not src: typed_network.spi uses the pre-granular syntax (inl, if/then, forall) and needs network.wide_inputs from the M2e patch, which src/network.spi doesn't have. Its landing needs a rewrite, so the destination isn't final.\nThe target\\ originals are left in place; the m3.c build output (6.9 MB) is regenerable and was not copied. The drafts' harness scripts (m1.ps1, m3.ps1, m3-patch.ps1, judges) lived in a session scratchpad and are lost.")
