inl tibia_headless_client () = Task ("TIBIA-HEADLESS-CLIENT", "Headless game client in Spiral (Rust target) for agents and the arena live layer: Canary 3.6.1 keeps the classic login protocol on loginProtocolPort 7171 (raw RSA private exponentiation over a 128-byte block with the datapack key.pem, then XTEA with the client key and Adler-32 checksums, src/server/network/protocol/protocollogin.cpp:125-135), so no HTTP login service is needed; allowOldProtocol=false; Canary accepts exactly CLIENT_VERSION 1511 (src/core.hpp:18), or 11.00 when allowOldProtocol is set; per-agent typed view (15x11 tiles) as the only observation; action-rate cap enforced at the protocol layer for parity; 2026-10-13 02:44 user: keep harnessing OTClient to the end (the baseline bots run as Lua inside it, and Spiral's Lua backend can run our policy there too); deferred until many parallel sessions are actually needed", Feature, P4, D6, 0u32, Paused, "TIBIA-LOCAL-WORLD,SPIRAL-BIGNUM-MODEXP,TIBIA-TCP-BYTES", "tibia,protocol,team:tibia", "current", "current")
