inl note_of_hopacsota_p4_8 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P4", 8u32, "2026-10-30T02:00Z", "main", "10-29 22:00 main, groom: READY TO START. Every dep is Done (HOPACSOTA-P2,SPIRAL-DIAGNOSTIC-LOCATIONS), so the item is unblocked though still Planned (P0, est 360 m). Pick-up: the compiler team (git-a6), per lane-roles, after the pack-7 install (next session). CORRECTION (10-29 22:24, git-a6): NOT ready. The kit deps (P2 only) understate the order: PLAN.md process rule 1 says a phase starts only when the previous gate's numbers are on the scoreboard, and gate 3 isn't there (HOPACSOTA-P3 is 60%, and tonight's fair run shows no w8 speed win). git-a6 adds P3 as a P4 dep and works P3 (a w8 CPU profile on the node) instead.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p4_9 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P4", 9u32, "2026-10-30T02:24Z", "compiler", "10-29 22:2x compiler: NOT READY by the plan, correcting main's 22:00 groom. PLAN.md process rule 1: 'A phase starts only when the previous gate's numbers are in the scoreboard. Starting early is drift.' The scoreboard's last row is Gate 2 (2b partial); gate 3 is not in it. P3 is 60% Active, and the fair run (P3 n37) shows no 8-worker speed win yet. The kit deps listed only P2, so they understated the order. deps += HOPACSOTA-P3.")
