inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_4 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 4u32, "2026-10-19T12:09Z", "helper-lane", "2026-10-19 08:09 helper-lane lap 1: verified the chain: the 10-15 groom said blocked by P1, but P1 is Done (10-17); the real chain is P2 (30%, Active) -> P4 (0%) -> P5, and PLAN.md process rule 1 forbids starting before Gate 4 numbers. Core check: spiral_compiler.fs has 0 Stream.Src uses and the hopacsota layer reads only SPIRAL_HOPACSOTA_POLICY (lines 53415/53420), so the D13 event stream P5 taps does not exist yet. The 121 HUD hits are gpt5parallel's contract HUD (fifty-row live HUD, CPU authority receipts, terminal final-row capability), which Phase 6 deletes with gpt5parallel: P5 must not build on it. Unblocks when P4 lands the D13 stream with tracing off-by-default within noise.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_5 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 5u32, "2026-10-19T13:02Z", "helper-lane", "2026-10-19 09:02 helper-lane lap 2: mapped D14's four HUD readouts (per-worker current specialization, frontier size, filled count, blocked waiters; PLAN D14) onto the seam points that already exist in the hopacsota layer (Session in PartEvalSeamsHopacsota, spiral_compiler.fs ~53397-53540), so D13's event union can be fixed before P4 starts: Deferred(key label) at Session.Defer (queue push = frontier +1), Taken(worker, key) at Drain's queue.[index] pick (frontier -1, current specialization), KeyBody(key, label) at key_body (specialization start), Filled(key) at fill and announce, Claimed/Waiting(key) at claim (the Waiting case appears only with grain 2b's parallel claim), Printed at print, Failed(marker) at fail. All seven are struct-sized (ints plus an interned key id), which keeps D13's off-by-default static flag cheap. Gate chain unchanged: P2 -> P4 -> P5.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_6 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 6u32, "2026-10-19T14:17Z", "helper-lane", "2026-10-19 10:17 helper-lane lap 3: wrote the D13 event union and the D14 HUD fold as lab/HOPACSOTA-P5/hud_events.fsx (8 struct cases Deferred/Taken/KeyBody/Filled/Claimed/Waiting/Printed/Failed over interned int ids; readout = per-worker current key, frontier, filled, blocked set; 5 replay checks incl. a stalled wait-for pair). Bounded fsi run: HUD-EVENTS-OK 5. Measured finding for D13's struct-sized claim: an F# struct union with distinct field names per case is 52 bytes (fields never overlap); with shared field names (worker, key, label; F# 9) it is 16 bytes. So the P4 event union must reuse field names across cases, or be a struct record kind+worker+key. Unchanged gate chain P2 -> P4 -> P5.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_7 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 7u32, "2026-10-24T11:49Z", "main", "2026-10-19 laps folded from the deleted history ledger (docs/agents/history/2026-10-19-backlog-laps, HISTORY-BACKLOG-LAPS-DRIFT): lap 4 11:29 (subagent): blocked: P4 (D13 stream) not started; event union ready in lab hud_events.fsx -> next: unblocks when HOPACSOTA-P4 starts (after P2 Gate 2) | lap 5 11:49 (subagent): blocked: P4 not started -> next: unblocks when HOPACSOTA-P4 starts | lap 6 18:26 (subagent): re-read: hud_events.fsx passes (HUD-EVENTS-OK 5); slowdown measurement needs an idle machine -> next: idle window: residuals with the HUD attached | lap 7 19:54 (subagent): re-read: unchanged; the HUD slowdown measurement needs an idle machine -> next: idle window")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_8 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 8u32, "2026-10-28T14:30Z", "compiler", "compiler 10-28 estimate 240m FROM MILESTONES (gate = PLAN.md P5): HUD as a Stream.Src tap consumer (per-worker spec/frontier/filled/blocked) 120m; gate residuals unchanged with HUD attached 60m; slowdown measured + published 60m. Sum = 240m.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_9 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 9u32, "2026-10-31T03:21Z", "main", "10-30 23:21 main: lab/HOPACSOTA-P5 is ARCHIVED (user, 10-30 22:5x: the lab dir didn't work and drifted; drafts don't live outside the repo). Archive 20261030-232045 under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive. Restore this folder with: pwsh i574n.github/scripts/scratch-archive.ps1 -Root C:\\home\\git\\spiral\\lab -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045\\manifest.tsv' -Only 'HOPACSOTA-P5\\*' -RestoreTo C:\\home\\git\\spiral\\lab. Resume this item's work in its real place in the repo, not in lab.")
inl note_of_hopacsota_p5_10 () = Note ("HOPACSOTA-P5", 10u32, "2026-11-01T04:50Z", "main", "main 00:5x LAB CODE IS SAFE (user 11-01 00:2x: 'check for all lab references in history... make sure we didn't lose that code... to repurpose them or groom their tasks'). This item's lab/HOPACSOTA-P5 folder (1 files: hud_events.fsx) is archived in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045 (blob-verified). Restore it into its proper repo place with: pwsh C:\\home\\git\\i574n.github\\scripts\\scratch-archive.ps1 -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <repo dir> -Only 'HOPACSOTA-P5/*'. Next step for the owner at its next pull: restore the useful files in place as incomplete drafts (Cells heals them in place), or record why it starts over.")
inl hopacsota_p6 () = Task ("HOPACSOTA-P6", "hopacsota Phase 6: promotion = AGENTS.md criterion (no missing, DISAGREE 0, all ok, apps/spiral compiles) + Gate 2 determinism; then the user decides deleting gpt5parallel's 159k lines (spiral/apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md)", Story, P0, D5, 60u32, Planned, "HOPACSOTA-P2", "compiler,hopacsota,main,team:compiler", "current", "current")
