inl note_of_spiral_formatter_1 () = Note ("SPIRAL-FORMATTER", 1u32, "2026-10-14T10:39Z", "user", "2026-10-14 06:39 user decisions recorded in spiral/apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/formatter/PLAN.md: Q1 core concat op + macro continuation; Q2/Q3 normalize (one canonical layout, built from the user's own templates; G2 becomes residual-identical canonical output); Q4 long guard as an aligned pipeline after when; Q5 fenced output exempt, other comments rewrapped; Q6 ;[ ] spaced everywhere; Q7 compiler section now, self-hosted Spiral later")
