inl note_of_bend2_in_spiral_10 () = Note ("BEND2-IN-SPIRAL", 10u32, "2026-10-31T03:21Z", "main", "10-30 23:21 main: lab/BEND2-IN-SPIRAL is ARCHIVED (user, 10-30 22:5x: the lab dir didn't work and drifted; drafts don't live outside the repo). Archive 20261030-232045 under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive. Restore this folder with: pwsh i574n.github/scripts/scratch-archive.ps1 -Root C:\\home\\git\\spiral\\lab -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261030-232045\\manifest.tsv' -Only 'BEND2-IN-SPIRAL\\*' -RestoreTo C:\\home\\git\\spiral\\lab. Resume this item's work in its real place in the repo, not in lab.")
