inl crate_gate_harden () = Task ("CRATE-GATE-HARDEN", "Harden the 1,000-line generated-crate gate (user 2026-10-15 23:00: nice seeing the 1k loc paying off): it already counts .rs + .spi per crate dir in eoie source-topology; make it a gate in every repo that emits Rust crates and decide whether .spi stays inside the count", TaskKind, P1, D3, 100u32, Done, "EOIE-CRATE-GATE", "eoie,gate,rust", "current", "current")
