inl note_of_cells_everywhere_20 () = Note ("CELLS-EVERYWHERE", 20u32, "2026-10-22T13:36Z", "x", "2026-10-22 09:36 x: x's part re-confirmed by a full run. Pre-commit run 5 (job-1792669355305-x-precommit-day5, exit 0) ran all 36 apps/client notebooks under Cells, simframes included, with 0 failures. A tree scan finds no .spi in x outside apps/client (apps/sim consumes the client sources through BuildSpiral), so x has no source that misses Cells coverage.")
