inl note_of_edition3_280_split_4 () = Note ("EDITION3-280-SPLIT", 4u32, "2026-10-29T21:54Z", "main", "10-29 17:5x main: PROVISIONAL estimate 720m by the D-base rule (EOIE-AGILE-CHECK-FIELDS n2: base(D6) x (1 - 0%), floored at 30, rounded up to 15). A milestone-based sizing pass (estimates-from-rules) replaces it.")
