inl note_of_x_done_73 () = Note ("X-DONE", 73u32, "2026-10-24T06:33Z", "x", "10-24 02:33 x: n72's requeue is now ONE call: pwsh %TEMP%\\x-world\\lib-draft\\requeue_after_block.ps1. It refuses (exit 75) while any live-gui window is held or waiting, so running it too early is safe. It starts normalize base4 -> decide4, chain21d (the 11 remaining notebooks) -> run8 decide3, the paging cw2 check, the part B and regexp-directive landers if they exited (both did, on the live-gui refusal), and the lookup check --after-ok the new part B lander. Dry run (-DryRun) printed the 8 expected starts. Run it at tibia's 'block end'.")
