inl note_of_fiscal_generic_99 () = Note ("FISCAL-GENERIC", 99u32, "2026-10-27T22:51Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 18:51 fiscal: NEW TOOL IN THE TREE: scripts/validate-manifests.ps1 [-ShowInvalid] referees every manifest's real documents against its official schema. Baseline: ubl-invoice 95/108 (9 = .NET's decimal cap on 39-digit X509SerialNumber, 4 truly invalid upstream: 1 DIAN, 2 UBL-TR HKS, 1 MyInvois 'abc'); creditnote 6/6, debitnote 3/3, applicationresponse 14/14, despatchadvice 5/5, receiptadvice 4/4, hu-nav 30/30, gr-mydata 2/2. Also fixed validate-example.ps1: it passed the document path as a URI, so names with U+FFFD failed 'not found'; now a FileStream + -LiteralPath.")
inl note_of_fiscal_generic_100 () = Note ("FISCAL-GENERIC", 100u32, "2026-10-27T23:50Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 19:50 fiscal: HANDOFF recheck: all 8 held programs (fiscal/lib-programs) apply in order on a fresh live copy; the live hashes are unchanged since the 16:04 landing (xml 58CA22E1, xsd_emit AD2D38E7, xsd_regex 4F2899EB, xpath 700D1CA2, xpath_eval ACB23D4F, schematron 3AF4E92C, schematron_run 4920BD08). Land after kit's 'TRAIN window closed'.")
