inl note_of_fiscal_generic_103 () = Note ("FISCAL-GENERIC", 103u32, "2026-10-28T00:27Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 20:27 fiscal: LANDED 20:16-20:17 via lib-guarded-do under Global\\spiral-lib-land, all 8 held programs in order (readers of tibia, main, compiler ccmr-land exempted after each owner confirmed; logged). Verified: each re-apply refuses; xsd_regex, xsd_emit, xpath, xpath_eval, schematron, schematron_run, json_schema, xsd_constraints + 3 probes type-check on a copy with core; fiscal generator + corpus_checks type-check. New hashes schematron_run CFFCF50B, schematron 7E5B89A1, xpath_eval BF5FEB4D, xpath 94F276FF, xsd_emit 092D2B40, xsd_regex 9CE5A7C3. fiscal/lib-programs deleted. Runtime proof: set-proof.")
inl note_of_fiscal_generic_104 () = Note ("FISCAL-GENERIC", 104u32, "2026-10-28T00:31Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 20:31 fiscal: HANDOFF set-proof (not launched: waits for no *bench* job on the node; x-nb-bench4 ETA ~20:45). Launch from session scratchpad recgroups/: launch-set-proof.ps1 -Mirror seta -Units 'ubl|nfe' -LibTests, then -Mirror setb -Units '^(?!.*(ubl|nfe))'. Stage now carries cl, my, hu, gr, in/gst, sa/zatca (Samples+Rules), pe/sunat-homologacion; the mirror lib = live (landed 20:17). PASS = every unit + reads_its_documents cell green; census prints zatca + zatca cen invalid counts.")
