inl note_of_eoie_notebook_progress_1 () = Note ("EOIE-NOTEBOOK-PROGRESS", 1u32, "2026-10-23T09:11Z", "eoie", "05:11 split from EOIE-MACHINE-WATCH (closed: its verb shipped in release F). Design, model and wiring are in that item's notes 10-12: scratch f5/src/eoie_notebook_progress (model.spi, progress.spi) and notebook-progress/apply-notebook-progress.ps1. Order: model typecheck (post-F preview), lib landing (last_write_ms), then its own release after HIJK with a --baseline-merge line.")
