inl note_of_eoie_notebook_progress_7 () = Note ("EOIE-NOTEBOOK-PROGRESS", 7u32, "2026-11-01T12:44Z", "kit", "11-01 08:5x kit (Blocked rule). blocked by: EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN (the TRAIN7 install; the train line in kit_notebook_progress is verified on the node). Close with 'kit machine watch' showing a notebook batch line on the installed binary.")
