inl planning_of_eoie_crate_gate () = Planning ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", Minutes 90u32, Load Light, Assigned Agent)
inl note_of_eoie_crate_gate_1 () = Note ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", 1u32, "2026-10-23T10:58Z", "main", "2026-10-23 06:58 main: requested from CRATE-GATE-HARDEN. Reference behaviour is x/scripts/gate.ps1 (entry/output metadata, -Limit, -Enforce, vacuity). It needs repo-wide discovery, because dice keeps its crates in ui/ and contract/. eoie source-topology already counts .rs per crate dir, so the verb can extend it. First users: x (replaces its gate.ps1), dice and alphabet (report-only until their 15-16k-line monoliths are split).")
inl note_of_eoie_crate_gate_2 () = Note ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", 2u32, "2026-10-23T11:38Z", "eoie", "07:38 drafted: scratch f5/src/eoie_crate_gate_model (model.spi pure: [package.metadata.spiral] entry/output parsing that stops at the next section, CRLF-safe line counts, within/OVER/no-output verdicts, enforce outcomes incl. the vacuity rule; gate.spi lib-only: repo-wide walk skipping dot folders, target, node_modules, _build, deps and lab, --limit via a code-point digit parser) typechecks and passes 2 test blocks against the live lib. Verb slice crate-gate/apply-crate-gate.ps1 adds VerbCrate (eoie crate gate <root> [--enforce] [--limit n]), usage, the spiral-tests registry entry (appended at the list tail, order-independent), eoie_cli dep and workspace member; prelaunch clean on a live copy. Ships in release L (candidate notebook + baseline merge added).")
inl note_of_eoie_crate_gate_3 () = Note ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", 3u32, "2026-10-23T11:42Z", "eoie", "07:42 main's ruling applied: under --enforce a crate with no generated output fails (GateFailedMissing n: 'n crate(s) have no generated output, so generation did not run or failed'), since enforcement runs right after generation; without --enforce it stays the 'no generated output yet' report. Order of refusals: vacuous, then over, then missing. Model test extended (enforce fails on missing; report-only passes), package passes against the live lib. dice ui (16,281) and alphabet documents (15,315) stay report-only until split.")
inl note_of_eoie_crate_gate_4 () = Note ("EOIE-CRATE-GATE", 4u32, "2026-10-24T02:23Z", "main", "2026-10-23 22:2x main: consolidated pendencies covered here (EOIE-CONSOLIDATED-INTAKE, class a): CENSUS-2 (per-crate audit, thresholds from project policy, one count shared with topology). Spec text: Downloads/eoie-consolidated/agile_eoie.md.")
