inl note_of_x_per_account_min_1_9 () = Note ("X-PER-ACCOUNT-MIN-1", 9u32, "2026-10-27T00:22Z", "x", "2026-10-26 20:22 x: full x verify pre-staged for when main's Zig index_of fix lands (main-serial-zig-index-of-5, gate step running in slot 1 since 18:44; main will message on land). The script is %TEMP%\\x-verify-full\\verify11.ps1, the same shape as node verify10 (mix deps.get, then apps/client/build.ps1 and apps/sim/build.ps1), plus SPIRAL_COMPILER_DLL pinned to the hash-verified 10/26 08:19 compiler and its hash printed first. On the land: sync spiral and x to mirror xv11, start it, and close X-PER-ACCOUNT-MIN-1, X-COMPAT-VS-POSTABLE and X-STUB-WEIGHTED-LIMIT on exit 0 (actions-lock runs locally, since the node verifies skip it). If main installs 5n first, re-stage the pinned compiler from the new install.")
