inl note_of_eoie_job_expect_1 () = Note ("EOIE-JOB-EXPECT", 1u32, "2026-10-24T02:23Z", "main", "Evidence 10-23: pwsh -File exits 0 unless the script calls exit; Cells run_suite.ps1 reported exit 0 with red tests until main fixed it, and its deferral is exit 75. Milestones: typed predicates on job_settled 60 m, host checks at settle 60 m, Deferred state in status/list 30 m, tutorial 30 m.")
inl note_of_eoie_job_expect_2 () = Note ("EOIE-JOB-EXPECT", 2u32, "2026-10-24T05:33Z", "main", "2026-10-24 01:33 main: draft ready as scratch job-expect\\apply.ps1 (dry run on live eoie src: 14 anchors match). JobDeferred and JobExpectationMissed settled cases, job_expectation plus the pure expectation_settled verdict over lib only (no new host code), supervise settles through it, launch takes --expect-exit / --expect-text / --deferred-exit and records them before the supervisor starts, 7 test cases. Plain substring --expect-text instead of a regex: deterministic and lib-only. Handed to the eoie team for preview in their train.")
inl note_of_eoie_job_expect_3 () = Note ("EOIE-JOB-EXPECT", 3u32, "2026-10-24T06:35Z", "main", "2026-10-24 02:35 main: launch.spi rebased onto the post-R tree (scratch job-expect\\launch-post-r.ps1, 12 anchors match on the eoie team's ge3r-chain copy). It follows the typed start_flag model: 3 string-valued flags (ExpectExit, ExpectText, DeferredExit), string fields in start_options, start_option_set taking the raw flag text beside the decimal value, and early missed or deferred settles mapped onto R's SettleFailed. The eoie team rebased model.spi and supervise.spi (usage counts) in job-expect-rebased.ps1; both ship as one stage with R's settle receipt widening.")
