inl eoie_gap_intake () = Task ("EOIE-GAP-INTAKE", "eoie gap <title> --verb <verb> --as <team>: one call files an eoie item for a gap hit mid-task, with the failed call (verb, exit, argv, cwd) in its note and every planning field set, so each bypass is reported at once (user 10-23: all those gaps should be reported for immediate fixes; prompt blocks: report what eoie lacked)", Story, P1, D2, 60u32, Planned, "EOIE-ADD-GROOMED", "kit,agile,consolidated,team:kit", "current", "current")
