inl note_of_eoie_gap_intake_1 () = Note ("EOIE-GAP-INTAKE", 1u32, "2026-10-24T02:23Z", "main", "Pairs with lanes-land-own-lib: the lane that hits the gap fixes it, then the tutorial goes into spec/one-call. Milestones: verb on agile add 45 m, prefill from EOIE_LAST_CALL or args 30 m, guide entry 15 m, tutorial 30 m.")
inl note_of_eoie_gap_intake_2 () = Note ("EOIE-GAP-INTAKE", 2u32, "2026-10-24T08:00Z", "eoie", "03:5x eoie: drafted, not yet typechecked (queued in job-1792828281123-eoie-post-block-night). Verb: agile gap <root> <title> --verb <verb> --as <team> [--exit <n>] [--argv <a>] [--estimate <m>]. New package agile_gap_intake (HostFree + LibReferenced, zero host macros). gap.spi is the pure model: a gap_flag union with flag words folded through lib reflection, a gap_request record, a request_from parser and request_checked refusals (missing title/verb, team not a lower-case word, exit not a number). Id <TEAM>-GAP-<VERB> takes the first free -N against state; tags team,gap,<first verb word>; a note with the failed call (exit, cwd, argv); 2 test blocks. intake.spi reuses agile_task_creation's agile_add for the write, so the add receipt, groomed planning (30m light agent) and P1 D2 TaskKind come from the one existing add path. Wiring: AgileGap subcommand + shape, state lock, one dispatch call, Cargo dep and workspace member (scratch gap-intake/apply-gap-intake.ps1 + gap-wiring.do; dry run 6/6 on post-S4, guarded for reruns). Needs lib env.command_line_arguments_from (draft lib-gaps-2/apply-arguments-from.ps1, gate queued). The EOIE_LAST_CALL prefill milestone is dropped: no such record exists (grep 0 in src), and the caller passes --exit/--argv. Left: typecheck, a CLI notebook test, a spec/one-call tutorial, and a stage slot (S5).")
inl note_of_eoie_gap_intake_3 () = Note ("EOIE-GAP-INTAKE", 3u32, "2026-10-24T10:58Z", "eoie", "06:48 eoie: typecheck PASS 3/3 (gap.spi, intake.spi, subcommand.spi) on post-R plus lib command_line_arguments_from applied to a lib copy. The first run's char comparisons were fixed with lib codes. Packaged in stage S5 (next-train\\apply-stage-S5.ps1). Left: lib landing, then the CLI notebook run against the S5 candidate and the spec case's expected output.")
inl note_of_eoie_gap_intake_4 () = Note ("EOIE-GAP-INTAKE", 4u32, "2026-10-28T10:30Z", "eoie", "10-28 groom (user via main): Paused. Last note 2026-10-24, nothing queued. Next step: check whether its remaining milestone shipped in TRAIN2c (installed kit.exe A5B55974, 10-28 05:25). If it did, close it with that evidence; if not, size the remaining slice from its last milestone note and resume it through agile next.")
