inl note_of_compiler_tmp_retire_53 () = Note ("COMPILER-TMP-RETIRE", 53u32, "2026-11-05T07:32Z", "compiler", "11-05 03:3x compiler: PACKS RULE APPLIED (the item's recorded next step). The 85 pack candidate folders of installed or superseded packs (pack6-pack40, the compiler-*-box/-node review arms, and the small probe candidates gadt*, p3*, guard*, mutualtail*, zigexp* ...) were archived with scratch-archive.ps1 -Root %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin-candidates -ListFile (dry run first; 8352 files, 1.27 GB, blob verify failures 0) to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261105-032848 (195 MB) and removed. Restore with -Restore '...\\20261105-032848\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <dir>. The dry run's duplicate store copy was deleted (same 8352-line manifest). Kept: pack41 (installed box + node), pack42 (installing), pack43 (queued), plus pack8-kit-delta and runner-3f1b7588 / runner-cuda1030, which may be other lanes' builds. Box and node undo for installed packs stays in spiral-bin\\compiler-installs. apps/compiler/tmp now holds compiler (host), formatter, lanes, samples, target, tests; no scripts left in tmp.")
inl note_of_compiler_tmp_retire_54 () = Note ("COMPILER-TMP-RETIRE", 54u32, "2026-11-05T15:04Z", "compiler", "11-05 11:0x compiler: PACKS RULE applied again. Candidates of installed or superseded packs pack41, pack42, pack43, pack44 and pack48 were archived with scratch-archive.ps1 -Root %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin-candidates -ListFile (dry run first: 5 folders, 619 files, 0.16 GB, blob verify failures 0) to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261105-110353 and removed. Restore: -Restore '...\\20261105-110353\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <dir>. The dry run's duplicate store 20261105-110332 (same 619 rows) was deleted. Kept: pack49 (node + vultr live), pack50 (box live), pack8-kit-delta, runner-3f1b7588, runner-cuda1030 (possibly other lanes'). Box/node undo stays in spiral-bin\\compiler-installs.")
