inl note_of_zeta_py_retire_1 () = Note ("ZETA-PY-RETIRE", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:14Z", "regex", "regex 08:1x FOLDED into ZETA-NUMERIC-CORE (user 11-02 asked for one final zeta; parent ZETA-FINAL). Research found the polyglot tests are FALSE PASSES: math.spi zeta__ (lines 255-266) returns the mpmath value, so the 12 tests never test the Spiral code, and the reflection formula uses pi^s instead of pi^(s-1). Close this item when ZETA-NUMERIC-CORE removes pyo3/mpmath.")
