inl note_of_spiral_macro_sigil_escapes_2 () = Note ("SPIRAL-MACRO-SIGIL-ESCAPES", 2u32, "2026-10-28T11:00Z", "compiler", "compiler 10-28 DONE: macro sigil escapes in the installed core 9FF1B708 -- spiral_compiler.fs:180668-180669 (respell @@/## <-> backslash-@/backslash-#, TokUnescapedChar carve-out; lexer already accepted both forms). Composed into 5n via macro-sigil-respell-apply.ps1 + blessed. Functional re-run delegated to the lanes vs installed; reopen on red.")
inl notebook_livemd_retire () = Task ("NOTEBOOK-LIVEMD-RETIRE", "Retire the 21 tracked .livemd files in the 10-26 round (user: 'convert the remaining livemd files'): 3 export twins (spiral/apps/spiral/spiral.livemd 143 KB, spiral/apps/wasm/spiral_wasm.livemd, polyglot/apps/perf/Perf.livemd) make their .spi the source and drop the export step (spiral/apps/spiral/build.ps1:27 --export-only); 11 F#-only or mostly F# (dice/lib/fsharp/dice_fsharp, alphabet/apps/hangul/hangul, polyglot apps/parser x2 and lib/fsharp x8) are ported to Spiral .spi or deleted, per file by whether anything still builds or reads them (dangling check by stem first); 5 with no Spiral (spiral apps/cells/notebooks/spiral, apps/lisp/lisp, polyglot examples/elixir/exercism, polyglot scripts/build, init) become .exs/.ps1 or stay, by the same reader check", Story, P0, D3, 80u32, Blocked, "POLYGLOT-RETIRE", "team:main,notebooks,livemd,migration,edition3,main", "current", "current")
