inl note_of_xsd_private_nominals_3 () = Note ("XSD-PRIVATE-NOMINALS", 3u32, "2026-10-30T15:37Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-30 11:37 fiscal: GROOM R3 status (2.8 d, before it goes stale): the lib change is landed (10-27 16:04). The open runtime claim is set-proof's 'the regenerated units declare their validated nominals private (N files)'. Last attempt fiscal-p7-set-ublj2 is VOID (0 files: the UBL invoice unit timed out before writing; FISCAL-MY-MYINVOIS n22). Next evidence today: fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-gen (job-1793370843334, running, CL + MDF-e, pack 7, live lib) checks the same claim, then fiscal-p7-set-ublj3 for UBL. Closes on a nonzero-file HOLDS.")
