inl note_of_xsd_any_complements_16 () = Note ("XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS", 16u32, "2026-10-29T13:44Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-29 09:44 fiscal: generator half proof: set-cfdi VOID (init: facturae.gob.es TLS alert on a fresh corpus), set-cfdi2 RED with a real bug in generator-complements.kit: cfdi_v4_0 called manifest_documents, which is defined ~70 lines below it (top-down scope). Fixed: CFDI's documents are the one stamped fixture as a literal path (as chile_envio_dte_v10 does); program re-cut and rehearsed, tree 28099567 -> FF920D9F. Corpus for mirror ac copied from land1029 (complete, 1156 files). Rerun: fiscal-set-cfdi3 job-1793281272369.")
