inl note_of_xsd_any_complements_21 () = Note ("XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS", 21u32, "2026-10-29T19:28Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-29 15:28 fiscal: operator fix LANDED 15:19:02 (xsd_emit F49F611A -> 5606F4B4), via lib-guarded-do in the 15:18 gap (no exemptions), hash equal to the pack-6b-proven copy (node stage spiral-bin-1029-6b, core 31CC96520D6B7269); main's closing document_test 22/22 over all gap lands. Byte-exact undo copies: C:\\home\\data\\fiscal-drafts\\land-1029\\{m7,sch2,mod,cells64b}\\base (not git HEAD: other lanes' unstaged lib hunks). Then the fiscal tree took generator-complements.kit + generator-signed-families.kit (generator D4948243 -> 324190CC -> 84A609E1, both applied with kit do; pre-apply copy saved). End-to-end proof RUNNING: fiscal-6b-set-signed (job-1793302064032, mirror sigs6b = live lib after the gap + this tree; units generated_cfdi_v4_0, cfdi_tfd_1_1, cfdi_pagos_2_0, mdfe_v3_00, cl_envio_dte_v10).")
inl note_of_xsd_any_complements_22 () = Note ("XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS", 22u32, "2026-10-30T23:38Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-30 19:38 fiscal: the 10-29 end-to-end proof's verdict was never recorded: fiscal-6b-set-signed (job-1793302064032, mirror sigs6b) finished exit 1. HOLDS: generated_cfdi_pagos_2_0 2/2, cfdi_tfd_1_1 2/2, cfdi_v4_0 2/2, so the complement union types and round-trips for CFDI. BROKEN: generated_cl_envio_dte_v10 0/2 (ETY-KindError: kind unification failure at line 5572 of the generated unit) and generated_mdfe_v3_00 1/2 (ETY-TermError at 8048: unification against staged s {signed_info ...}, i.e. the XSD-SIGNING-STAGES staged signature type). The tree's generated/ copies date from 10-27, so they cannot show whether today's generator still produces these. Re-proof on the current tree queued: fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-signed2 (node job-1793403473254, set-proof-c on mirror e3lv, pack 7 F2F6F4CB5A18, units ^generated_(mdfe_v3_00|cl_envio_dte_v10)$, after brsigned, cap 48 h counted from queue time). Closes on both HOLDS; if either still breaks, the failing line goes to XSD-SIGNING-STAGES (mdfe) or here (cl, the xs:any complement).")
inl note_of_xsd_any_complements_23 () = Note ("XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS", 23u32, "2026-10-31T04:55Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-31 00:55 fiscal: EARLIER EVIDENCE FOUND for this item's open proof (FISCAL-EDITION3-ROUND n of 10-30 15:14): fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-gen (node job-1793370843334, e3lv, pack 7 F2F6F4CB5A18) already ran generated_cl_envio_dte_v10 and generated_mdfe_v3_00 2/2 each on today's lib (generator output identical between the edition-2 and edition-3 generators, 148/148), so the 10-29 breaks recorded in n22 (cl kind error, mdfe staged unification) are fixed on the current lib. fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-signed2 (queued after brsigned) re-runs both as the item's named proof.")
