inl note_of_fiscal_cl_dte_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-CL-DTE", 8u32, "2026-10-30T01:59Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-29 21:59 fiscal: GROOM: the signed-stage generator (M6, FISCAL-TYPEFEATURE-DRIFT) broke this family: fiscal-6b-set-signed (10-29, pack 6b) failed generated_cl_envio_dte_v10 with a kind error (x_envio_dte_set_dte held x_dte_def_type without its stage). Cause: inline SetDTE's candidate key skipped the owner chain, and the ref DTE was read before dereferencing. Fixed in held program xsd-staged-element-signatures (xsd_emit 161D00F5, HOLDS 24/24 post-land). This row's runtime proof of 10-28 predates M6 and so needs a re-run with M6: end-to-end check fiscal-6b-sgnset2-mdfe-cl (pre-window mirror) is running. Progress stays 80 until CL compiles staged.")
