inl note_of_fiscal_hu_nav_7 () = Note ("FISCAL-HU-NAV", 7u32, "2026-10-30T16:14Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-30 12:14 fiscal: GROOM R3 status (2.3 d): the remaining step is a re-proof. This row's runtime evidence (setc 10-28, compiler 4FD712E9E357) predates pack 6b (stale-pin restamp, FISCAL-GENERIC n of 10-29 15:18), so its 30 real NAV InvoiceData documents must round-trip again on the current lib and compiler. Queued: fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-hugst (job-1793376840350-fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-hugst), units generated_hu_nav_3_0 (+ its partner), on e3lv = live lib + the edition-3 draft + the box corpus, pack 7 staged, after fiscal-p7-set-ublj3, so it runs serially with fiscal's other jobs. Closes at 100 on HOLDS for its documents claim.")
inl note_of_fiscal_hu_nav_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-HU-NAV", 8u32, "2026-10-31T00:12Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-30 20:12 fiscal: RE-PROVEN, CLOSING. fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-hugst (node job-1793376840350, mirror e3lv = live lib + edition-3 draft + box corpus, pack 7 F2F6F4CB5A18) finished exit 0 with 0 broken claims: the generator 22/22 (0 memo hits), the regenerated units declare their validated nominals private, and generated_hu_nav_3_0 passes every test (2/2). Its writes_its_example test reads all 30 deps/corpus/hu/nav-samples InvoiceData documents, round-trips each through the generated reader/writer, and fails on any xml.first_difference, so the documents claim HOLDS on the current lib and compiler. 85 -> 100, Done.")
