inl note_of_fiscal_my_myinvois_46 () = Note ("FISCAL-MY-MYINVOIS", 46u32, "2026-11-05T16:17Z", "fiscal", "11-05 12:1x local fiscal: PENDING on the NODE: job-1793895376229-fiscal-twin (queued after job-1793886615820, cap 4 h counted from its start): a scratch tree with the t1101 base lib + the landed xml 765A371D / xml_codec EFAE1583 / document_syntax + the sentinel xsd_emit D00BE390, live src with src2 families 8F72669F and src3 generator CD099775 + a harness main writing only ubl_invoice_2_1; then it gates generated_ubl_invoice_2_1 (cell cap x3 in the scratch tree only) and reports the twin calls, any 'differs from its JSON twin' lines and the ParserErrors count of the regen compile. Expected: 21 twin calls, unit green.")
inl note_of_fiscal_my_myinvois_47 () = Note ("FISCAL-MY-MYINVOIS", 47u32, "2026-11-05T18:05Z", "fiscal", "11-05 14:0x local fiscal: TIMING (node t1101, one Cells run at a time): the facet gate's last unit generated_ubl_invoice_2_1 has been running since 12:49 (155 XML + 22 JSON read-backs, 5 h scratch cap); after it come the facet regen (+ format + gates of the 9 newly included families' carrier units), then the src Cells confirmation, then this item's twin job-1793895376229. The twin job may therefore not finish before the 21:00 end of today's run; if it has not started by then it stays queued on the node and its verdict is pending, not green. The lib half (landed) and the generator half (body-proven on vultr) are not affected.")
inl note_of_fiscal_my_myinvois_48 () = Note ("FISCAL-MY-MYINVOIS", 48u32, "2026-11-05T20:15Z", "fiscal", "11-05 16:1x local fiscal: two node runs came back VOID (environment, not code), both from the t1101 mirror's STALE lib/spiral: it lacks the box-only lib modules ledger / money (landed unstaged on the box 11-03), xml.first_difference_by (landed today) and xsd_emit.dereferenced_parts, and it still orders modules by package.spiproj, so an xml_codec copied in ahead of decimal cannot see decimal. (1) src Cells job-1793886615820: every module failed together (the package type check needs posting -> ledger / money and canon_coverage -> dereferenced_parts); stopped by me. (2) MyInvois twin job-1793895376229: the regen compile failed (xml_codec: Unbound decimal; document_syntax: Unbound read_text / decoded_by / present). FIX: both now unpack the BOX lib/spiral (lib.zip 1C36B453, toml-ordered, the lib every vultr proof used) into their scratch trees. RE-QUEUED in priority order behind the running facet-extra gates job-1793908968483 (which uses the facet gate's proven setup and is unaffected): job-1793909583928-fiscal-twin2 (script FE325247), then job-1793909634925-fiscal-reports-gate2 (script 89E28B5A, src zip D742F390). The vultr Rust body runs of every module stay the landing evidence; these are the Cells confirmations, pending on the node.")
inl fiscal_pe_sunat () = Task ("FISCAL-PE-SUNAT", "Peru SUNAT UBL 2.1 customization", Story, P2, D4, 85u32, Active, "XSD-IMPORTED-NAMESPACE-ELEMENTS", "team:fiscal,fiscal,generic,country,team:fiscal,user-batch", "current", "current")
