CONTRACT-REJECTION-DIAGNOSTICS\nLOST design docs delphi-arc-memory-design.md, note-rust-match-dup-wildcard-design.txt, rust-derive-inference-header-resolution.md, lib-string-op-codegen-size.md | WAS TEMP | SOURCE backlog:DELPHI-ARC-MEMORY n3 (2.3k chars), RUST-MATCH-DUPLICATION n24 (2.1k), RUST-DERIVE-INFERENCE n4-n5 (6.4k), RUST-STRING-WRAPPER-INLINE n1/n3 | STATE recoverable (each note carries the design summary and names the lost doc; the implementer re-derives detail from the code) | ITEM those\nLOST zig-export-fix-design.md, ccmr-consumer-census.txt, mutual-tail-loops-probe.spi, rswi-lib-draft.txt | WAS TEMP | SOURCE backlog:BACKEND-COVERAGE-GAPS n43 (shipped), COMPILER-CROSS-MACHINE-REPRO n10, MUTUAL-TAIL-LOOPS n3-n4 (3.3k), RUST-STRING-WRAPPER-INLINE n3 | STATE dropped (zig shipped) / recoverable (the others: the notes carry them) | ITEM those\nLOST kit2 scratch remote-run.ps1, mirror-test.ps1, node-watch.log, ci-cli-path-fix.do | WAS TEMP | SOURCE remote.ps1 + node-watch.ps1 in i574n.github/scripts; ci fixture fix in the kit tree (EOIE-CI-DEV-WORKFLOW n15) | STATE recovered (superseded) except mirror-test.ps1: recoverable from KIT-REMOTE-SYNC n3 | ITEM KIT-REMOTE-SYNC\nNOT LOST (stale citations): lab/bisect.ps1 is lab/COMPILER-PACK-SPEED-AB/bisect.ps1; lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md is apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md; packs apply-ccmr-det-root/-sourcelink, apply-export-string-rc (NOT shipped: EXPORT-STRING-PARAM-RC draft, pending a pack), apply-hopacsota-p2-alias-order and apply-delphi-string-literal-index all survived in apps/compiler/packs.\nPass 2: read the IVar measure output and the rest of the node job logs (C:\\home\\remote\\hopacsota-p2\\p3-* dirs).")
