inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_7 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 7u32, "2026-10-29T12:03Z", "kit", "10-29 08:0x kit, pass 1 batch 2 (kit's 10-28 scratch drafts). Method: node:remote-stage\\m5-commit-bundle (10-28 10:34-11:33, the newest regen-compare) hashed three ways (base, cand, live tree). Its base holds TRAIN4 plus 7 crates found nowhere else; its cand holds 30 more edited files. Durable copy taken off the node: C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\kit-bundles\\kit-bundles-20261029.tar (sha256 028A1089FFA6..., train3/train4/m5 base+cand sources, extracted beside it in x\\).\nLOST TODO-markers M5 (git-delta cache) and its hand split | WAS scratch clean\\wip-merge\\merge.spi | SOURCE node:remote-stage\\m5-commit-bundle\\cand\\src\\agile_todo_merge + agile_todo_cache (new crates) | STATE recoverable | ITEM KIT-WIP-TODO-MARKERS (n13-n15)\nLOST kit do commit split, concurrent-edit slice 2 | WAS scratch clean\\do-commit | SOURCE same bundle: kit_do_commit + kit_do_store (new crates) plus kit_do_edit/kit_do_program/kit_do_read edits in cand | STATE recoverable | ITEM EOIE-DO-CONCURRENT-EDITS (n7, n9)\nLOST kit remote status M1 crate | WAS scratch clean\\remote-status | SOURCE same bundle: kit_remote_status (new crate; its generated .rs is in cand-out) | STATE recoverable | ITEM EOIE-REMOTE-EXECUTOR (n12)\nLOST tree-write window kind and the edit-intent leases | WAS scratch clean\\tree-write\\tree-write.do | SOURCE same bundle cand: kit_machine_windows window_model/windows, kit_window_admission, kit_window_query, kit_job_gate, kit_job_slot (LIVE=BASE, so they copy cleanly) | STATE recoverable | ITEM EOIE-TREE-READ-RECORD (n15), EOIE-EDIT-INTENT-LEASES\nLOST census probe fixes (existential '\\? x.' and use-weighted credit groundwork) | WAS scratch | SOURCE same bundle cand: kit_style_census probes.spi (LIVE=BASE) + census.spi (DIVERGED, needs a merge) | STATE recoverable | ITEM EOIE-STYLE-RATCHET (n40, n41)\nLOST x's lint shadows for TRAIN4 (SPI-SHADOW-BEFORE-USE: kit_lint_s