inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_11 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 11u32, "2026-10-29T12:09Z", "x", "2026-10-29 08:12 x, batch 2 (corrections from kit and main):\nLOST kit-lint-shadows crates + wiring.do | WAS scratchpad kit-lint-shadows\\ | SOURCE node:remote-stage\\m5-commit-bundle\\cand\\src (and shadows-bundle\\cand\\src, byte-identical; copied by kit to C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\kit-bundles) | STATE recoverable (kit restores it by three-way merge after the TRAIN3 retry; rides TRAIN4; no x redo) | ITEM SPI-SHADOW-BEFORE-USE\nLOST x-precommit-next\\drafts (item .md + apply_*.ps1 for X-READ-BUDGET, X-LOOKUP-LIMITS, X-THREAD-RESUME, X-LIB-FIRST-PRELUDE, X-TOKEN-REFRESH-SAFE, X-PAGING-GUARD, X-INVARIANTS-ROW-KIND) | WAS %TEMP%\\x-precommit-next | SOURCE gone | STATE dropped (every item is Done, closed by verify25 10-28 under X-WIP-VERIFY n9/n13) | ITEM X-WIP-VERIFY\nLOST x-world\\lib-draft\\apply_gleam_* (15) | WAS %TEMP%\\x-world\\lib-draft | SOURCE gone | STATE dropped (landed 10-24 per LIB-GLEAM-OS-ARMS n28, except fs-heal-4 = the redo row in n6) | ITEM LIB-GLEAM-OS-ARMS\nLOST X-HAND-UNITS G1 wiring | SOURCE node:C:\\home\\remote\\xunits (confirmed by main's reading too) | STATE recoverable, parked | ITEM X-HAND-UNITS\nLOST pre-respell x tree (node mirror xv20, removed by x at 10-29 07:2x) | STATE dropped if verify29 is green; x removes no more mirrors today | ITEM X-EDITION3-RESPELL\nNEW home for unlanded x drafts: x/lib-programs/ (repo-tracked, unstaged), no TEMP.")
inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_12 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 12u32, "2026-10-29T12:15Z", "compiler", "10-29 08:1x compiler, PASS 1 batch 3 (main's heal list, checked against item state and the core):\nLOST pack folders of COMPILER-DEAD-ARM-GLOBALS (14 paths), PACK-NEXT-2 (7), PACK-NEXT-4 (7) | WAS TEMP pack-* dirs | SOURCE gone (only remote-stage\\pack-next5n\\delphi-literal-index.py survives) | STATE dropped: all three items are Done, with their passes in the installed core (main groom 10-27 21:2x, PACK-NEXT-2 n25, PACK-NEXT-4 n29; COMPILER-DEAD-ARM-GLOBALS n52 = 5n accepted) | ITEM those\nLOST 5 patched candidate cores | WAS TEMP pack-* candidate dirs | SOURCE regenerate: packs/apply-*.ps1 on HEAD | STATE dropped (shipped packs live in HEAD 9FF1B708; open drafts are reproducible from their appliers, as shown by apply-hopacsota-p3-ivar.ps1 reproducing its built core 6C960A7CCC717C79 byte-exact) | ITEM PROFILE-WIPE-RECOVERY\nLOST FORMATTER-KEEP-BREAKS lane docs (docs\\lanes-formatter, 9 paths) | WAS TEMP / lane folder | SOURCE git: lanes/formatter/PLAN.md@0ec501fb (cited in apps/compiler/tmp/AGENTS.md) | STATE recoverable (git show) | ITEM FORMATTER-KEEP-BREAKS\nLOST .claude\\jobs tmp notes (STABLE-ENTRY-POINTS after-bless RUNBOOK.md / mapping.md / root-causes.md; CI-COMPILER-FULL-SUITE cases.md + repros; HOPACSOTA-P7 style-rules.md) | WAS ~/.claude/jobs tmp | SOURCE gone for this lane: session 88a146f8's context starts at 10-29 07:16; nothing pre-wipe is held | STATE dropped from the compiler lane (another lane's context may still hold them) | ITEM STABLE-ENTRY-POINTS, CI-COMPILER-FULL-SUITE, HOPACSOTA-P7\nLOST node TEMP probes pascal-index-probe(2), record-fill-proof, xc-overflow-probe, zigemit-083745, matrix-bundle (lean-ab.ps1), export-lib-proof, rsprobe | WAS node %TEMP% | SOURCE C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\node-temp\\extracted\\<name> | STATE recovered (rescued copy), no redo: proof artifacts of concluded work (DELPHI-STRING-LITERAL-INDEX Done; Zig Ex