inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_13 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 13u32, "2026-10-29T12:20Z", "kit", "10-29 08:2x kit, pass 1 batch 3 (restore staged, nothing applied yet). Three-way merges, computed into durable staging outside the profile:\nLOST kit half of TRAIN4 + the m5 drafts (batch 1-2 rows: kit-clip, kit-lines, waits-column, part-at, rename-retry, text-replace-cas, M5 todo cache, kit_do_commit/kit_do_store, kit_remote_status, tree-write, census probes, x's lint shadows) | WAS scratch + node bundles | SOURCE C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\kit-bundles\\merged-m5: 73 files, 0 conflicts (26 new in 7 crates: agile_todo_cache, agile_todo_merge, kit_do_commit, kit_do_store, kit_lint_shadows, kit_lint_shadows_core, kit_remote_status; 47 take-theirs where live still equals the 10-28 08:16 ancestor; m5 deletes nothing); script merge-m5.ps1 beside it | STATE recoverable, staged | ITEM EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN\nLOST lib half (sm'.clip fixed, split_nth, all_digits, bytes_between; env.set/remove_environment_variable; file_system.read_text_or_empty) | WAS scratch lib copies | SOURCE C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\kit-bundles\\merged-lib: sm'.spi and env.spi take-theirs, file_system.spi merged cleanly around main's 07:39 blank lines; am'.spi conflicted only on average, where live and bundle made the same change, so it resolves to live and drops out | STATE recoverable, staged | ITEM EOIE-GRANULAR-MIGRATION, EOIE-HEAL-BOUNDARY, LIB-DOTNET-ONLY-BODIES\nOrder and rule: (1) TRAIN3 publishes; (2) lib window: re-run merge-tree.ps1 against the live lib at land time, because tibia's env guard is landing in env.spi and a stale take-theirs would revert it; land through lib-guarded-do, then gate; (3) re-run merge-m5.ps1 against the live kit tree, apply, regen-compare; (4) TRAIN4.\nLOST rclone remotes | WAS scoop\\persist\\rclone\\rclone.conf | SOURCE gone; the file exists again but is 0 bytes, so a path check would call it healed | STATE user-step (it holds credentials) | ITEM PROFILE-WIPE-RECOVERY\nLOST TRAIN release launcher scripts (release-build-job-<NAME>.ps1, one per train) | WAS %TEMP% | SOURCE regenerate: replaced by the repo-tracked kit/scripts/release-train.ps1 (unstaged; regen, debug candidate, positive control, candidate notebooks, build.ps1 install, smoke); its first run is TRAIN3 job-1793275863025 | STATE redo, done | ITEM EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN")
inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_14 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 14u32, "2026-10-29T12:21Z", "main", "10-29 08:3x main, cross-lane pass 1, part C: all 48 folders rescued from the node's TEMP are checked against the repos (main scratchpad ledger-rescued-drafts.tsv). Landed 15, probe-only 13, build-output 18, unlanded 2, partly 0, drifted 0. Every applier checked has its New text in the repo and its Old text gone, committed in HEAD.\nThe two unlanded ones are now settled:\n- lib-gate-kit: RETIRED in favour of lib_gate.ps1 plus lib-guarded-do.ps1 (LIB-GATE-KIT-STAGED-LAND note).\n- rmd-wildcard: RESTORED into lab/RUST-MATCH-DUPLICATION (note there).\nCaveats, not losses:\n- registry-planner landed as a newer copy in spiral/lab/PACKAGE-REGISTRY-DESIGN, and node-blog-post's posts and scripts sit in the fork; both are untracked, so they live only in the working tree.\n- The v1 applier in cli-args-usage must NOT be re-applied (v2 landed 10-28, CLI-ARGS-STYLE n30).\n- matrix-bundle's accept.ps1 and compare-accept.ps1 were not on the node; rebuild them only when the next bundle accept needs them.\nRunning tally across parts A-C: main has nothing left to recover. The remaining redo rows belong to the lanes, and each lane has its own list (messages from 08:1x to 08:2x).")
