inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_21 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 21u32, "2026-10-29T14:21Z", "kit", "10-29 10:2x kit, pass 1 batch 4 (state updates after the TRAIN3 retry):\nLOST TRAIN3 run record and per-notebook results (job-1793192300314: 67/69, reds ps_cli kill_with_mine and stop_cli memory cap) | WAS %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\jobs | SOURCE regenerate: the retry job-1793275863025 ran 66/73 on the live tree, reproduced BOTH old reds, and found their causes. stop_cli: the test predates TRAIN3's 2 s start settle; fixed with --settle-ms 0. ps_cli: a real regression since TRAIN2c's owner-parent (mine_verdict allowed any in-session pid before checking the job author); fixed with ownership first and a regression test. table_cli and table_test_cli pass. The rerun job-1793282979350 is running | STATE recovered | ITEM EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN (n181)\nLOST pending-test-fix.do (KIT-PENDING-DANGLING's moved test) | WAS scratch clean\\kit-rename | SOURCE none needed: both halves are live (workspace_primitives/files.spi:26 pending_path, :29 the test) | STATE dropped (no redo) | ITEM KIT-PENDING-DANGLING (n3)\nLOST release-train launcher scripts | WAS %TEMP% release-build-job-*.ps1 | SOURCE regenerated as repo-tracked kit/scripts/release-train.ps1; its first run found 3 bugs of its own, all fixed (candidate under target/candidate broke kit_checkout's layout; entry files with no test blocks were selected; module tests now need ^///>, ^:# non-static or ^test) | STATE redo, done | ITEM EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN")
inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_22 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 22u32, "2026-10-29T14:21Z", "main", "10-29 10:3x main, SWEEP 1 (transcript deltas 12:10Z to 14:04Z plus ledger notes n1-n20; main scratchpad sweep-1.tsv): 20 rows, 3 new losses, 4 unposted recoveries, 3 contradictions, 10 nudges. Routed to each lane at 10:3x with only its own rows.\nMain's rows, posted here:\n- LOST lib-gate-retention\\bin-sweep.ps1 and sweep.ps1 | WAS %TEMP% | SOURCE gone | STATE dropped, forensic only (the DELETE-ROOT-GUARD audit could not cover them) | ITEM DISK-CLEANUP.\n- LOST ~150 memory files still PARTIAL (index line plus backlog notes) | WAS ~/.claude/projects/C--home-git/memory | SOURCE backlog plus live sessions | STATE redo, rewrite each when its fact comes up; MEMORY.md line 1 lists the rebuilt ones | ITEM PROFILE-WIPE-RECOVERY.\n- LOST the four LIB-LIST-SUGAR-REST appliers | STATE dropped (the item closed Done at 12:36Z) | ITEM LIB-LIST-SUGAR-REST.\n- User-side, by name only: /login per tab, Electrum, x-api.env, rclone.conf (0 bytes), and the OneDrive online recycle bin. The bin EXPIRES around 11-27 (30 days from the wipe) and is a possible restore source, so the user hears about it at 21:00.\n- DURABILITY: main's unlanded drafts (env-guard, fs-guard, lib-average, c-shim-reserve, lustre5, wallet undo, the land-blank undo copies, rt-canon) are copied OUTSIDE the profile to C:\\home\\data\\main-drafts (46 files). The hourly profile mirror stays as the net.\nOther lanes' rows (each told directly):\n- kit: post the TRAIN3 run record (retry 66/73) and pending-test-fix.do (no redo) as rows; re-merge merged-lib against the live env.spi before main's guard lands.\n- x: post LIB-OTP-NAME (redone, proven); fs-heal-4 waits on tibia's overlap answer, which waits on the user's go.\n- fiscal: restate the complements generator and ubl_json rows as recovered-pending-proof (set-cfdi3 and set-ublj running); copy lander3.ps1 and the undo copies out of TEMP; FISCAL-BR-DELPHI-BENCH redo rows go