inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_27 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 27u32, "2026-10-29T15:21Z", "main", "10-29 11:2x main, SWEEP 2 (transcripts 14:04Z to ~15:12Z plus notes n21-n26; main scratchpad sweep-2.tsv): 16 rows, 0 new losses, 0 unposted recoveries, 2 contradictions, 2 unanswered nudges, 12 cross-lane HAZARDS. Every sweep-1 nudge was answered (kit n21, fiscal n23 with drafts copied to C:\\home\\data\\fiscal-drafts, x n24, git-a6 n25) except tibia's go and x's fs-heal-4, which waits on tibia.\nContradictions, corrected here:\n- tibia's 10-27/28 stage verdicts are STALE, not just likely stale: its run-gate.ps1 pinned a 10-26 compiler (core 022C3338096B). Re-gate with -RequireCore before any land.\n- spill-lf-apply.ps1 needs NO redo: LUA-FUNCTION-LIMITS has been Done since 10-28 and the applier went into compiler 5n. Row -> dropped.\nHazards acted on at 11:2x:\n- Notebook 'main' defaults to Zig (it hit seal.spi and Perf). Memory notebook-main-default-zig written, broadcast to all lanes.\n- Junction inside a TEMP lib copy reads the live lib (x's Test-RealCopy). Main's proof copies were checked: 0 reparse points in all 16.\n- The node's C:\\home\\git\\spiral checkout is stale (112 vs 236 lib files, no iggy.spi). Broadcast; folded into RUNNER-STALE.\n- A broken symlink spiral\\target\\build\\spindle\\xsim-build\\lib\\spiral_kino\\priv -> apps\\kino\\priv (target gone) made recursive scans throw. The dangling LINK was removed (not its target).\n- Shared i574n.github/scripts and apps/cells/spi/lib_gate.ps1 hold several lanes' unstaged edits at once. Broadcast: never checkout or restore them, anchored edits only; the user commits them together.\n- The profile-mirror vanish failure: hardened (existence filter plus a tolerant size read), and the real run at 11:19 passed (profile-mirror-20261029-111952.tgz, hash-verified on the node).\nHazards routed to owners:\n- git-a6: the lib default chars (base:497, reflection:57/83) are '0' today, fixed by the pack-7 lexer arm; settle the TyIntSwitch unclosed brace in the pack-7 review.\n- x: switch agile calls to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\bin\\kit.exe after TRAIN3 publishes.\n- fiscal: mark the seta/setb/setc verdicts (10-26 stage) stale; watch fiscal-set-cfdi3 (81 B of output after 82 min, possibly hung).\n- kit: KIT-PATH-TAG-PARSE (path_tag_contract failing to parse unnoticed) lands after TRAIN3, alongside the pack-7 parse-error attestation.\nOpen: tibia is PAUSED on the user's stop with 14 items waiting. The mobile push to the user is disabled, so it goes in the 21:00 report.")
