inl note_of_backlog_dangling_1030_2 () = Note ("BACKLOG-DANGLING-1030", 2u32, "2026-10-30T14:15Z", "main", "10-30 10:15 main applied R1-R4 to its rows (after healing's all-clear at 10:0x). R1 user-batch + assignee=user (6): TREE-SITTER-SPIRAL, TREE-PAGES-V2, ZED-TEST-RUNNABLES, SPIRAL-INDEPENDENT, CI-ACTIONS-LATEST, UPSTREAM-POST-1-VANILLA (its dep is Done; only the fork commit + PR are left). NOT R1 after reading the last notes: PIPELINES-GREEN (currency_converter e2e is agent work), CI-COMPILER-FULL-SUITE and CI-NIX (blocked on PIPELINES-GREEN, group D), HOPACSOTA/-P6 (compiler's proofs), SELF-CHECKING-SAMPLES (gated by SAMPLES-TO-TEST-BLOCKS; assignee left as is), DISK-CLEANUP (contained hourly; only the WSLg off-switch is the user's), PROFILE-WIPE-RECOVERY (healing's). R2 owner team + assignee agent (8): QUERY-CACHE-COMPILER, CODEGEN-READABLE-2, FORMATTER-KEEP-BREAKS, SPIRAL3-EDITIONS -> compiler; EXECUTABLE-ATLAS, PORTABLE-PRIMITIVES, LIB-OTP-ACTORS, LIB-PAR-MAP -> main (LIB-PAR-MAP first; it gates Active BACKEND-BALANCE). R3: LIB-REACTORS, SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR, KINO-HOT-PATHS, LIB-USAGE-DIAGNOSTICS Active -> Paused, each with its next step; GLEAM-RUST-SPLIT's next step now has an owner (LIB-PAR-MAP part 4, main); MUTUAL-TAIL-LOOPS left to compiler. R4 decided: LIB-CANON-NAMES (split runtime.spi into process + cli_args), CI-K3S (spiral/deploy/k3s, per org-tooling). The pair rows not named here are untouched.")
