inl note_of_edition3_manifest_model_10 () = Note ("EDITION3-MANIFEST-MODEL", 10u32, "2026-10-31T10:45Z", "main", "10-31 06:45 main, pack-9 install waiter gave up at 06:44 after 300 min (kit train5e ran the whole time; the installed compiler was also in use by 2 erl daemons). The dry run still reproduces the reviewed candidate from today's live source (core 4585FC131BC34C80, host 57F3152B25E561E0). Relaunched with a 600-min limit (bkxml6b77): installs under a compiler-install window once no train runs and nothing uses the installed compiler; install-pack.ps1 now also removes the Cells domain stamp so domain.gleam regenerates with the new compiler. Pending after the install: core DLL equals candidate, smoke samples, apply-cells.ps1 in a Cells window, copy sample/manifest_derived_order into apps/compiler/tmp/samples.")
