inl note_of_x_node_verify_script_4 () = Note ("X-NODE-VERIFY-SCRIPT", 4u32, "2026-10-31T20:42Z", "x", "2026-10-31 16:42 x: verify42 (job-1793464035018, 3 h 57 min, xqueue1) by n3's rule: PASS. Launched by i574n.github/scripts/x-node-verify.ps1 (REMOTE-SYNC-OK for spiral and x, job start ok, the land command printed). The verify passed SIM-IN-SPIRAL n145's rule: exit 0; the five 'x verify /' steps exit 0; all 43 client and 23 sim notebooks passed; x-compat 0 in 43 and 30 files; the 11 fixtures accepted through the CLI and unchanged in the land dry run; 'thread_run rejects a tampered thread'; no mix xsim/mix test. Land dry run: 24 to land (all generated xsim_frames sources from the 12:27 sync, older than the live simframes/sim_serve: held, as before) and 2 'conflicts' on apps/client/README.md and apps/sim/spi/README.md whose only differences are the doc edits made after the sync (the run's copies are the pre-edit files), so the live files stay. DONE. The old launcher C:\\home\\data\\x-drafts\\launchers\\launch-x-verify33.ps1 is archived with scratch-archive.ps1 and the emptied x-drafts folder removed (DATA-DIR-HOME).")
