inl note_of_data_dir_home_1 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 1u32, "2026-10-31T12:49Z", "main", "10-31 08:49 main. User 10-30 22:5x (relayed by kit): 'this c:/home/data dir i never asked, some lane came up with it then drifted. we gotta slowly heal'. A PreToolUse hook now blocks new files there. CENSUS 08:4x (folder: files, GB, newest): backlog-census 78/0.00/10-31; compiler-installs 124/0.16/10-29 (install-pack.ps1's default backup dir: FIXED, default is now %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin\\compiler-installs); cuda-python 148/0.03; derive-land 1; e3-samples 1258/0.00/10-30; fiscal-drafts 12165/0.49/10-31; heal-test 0; kit-drafts 13/0.04; lib-drafts 5357/0.24/10-29; main-drafts 45/0.00/10-31 (main: 8 finished folders archived 08:44 as 20261031-084402; left: cells-window6.ps1 + cells-daemon-port + headings-cleanup until window 6 lands, clip-rust until LIB-MACRO-HEAL-CLIP-RUST, commit-suggestion.md); mirror-retire 8; node-checkout-only-2026-10-29-extract 326; pack7-review 21; pack8-drafts 37; pack8-review 636; rescue-2026-10-28 25915/0.53; rescue-2026-10-31 30; runner-archive-2026-10-29 6, -10-30 6; samples-6b-snapshot-2026-10-29 527; undo 40; vss-shadow1-ro 0; wow-retail-11.2.7 1/0.64; x-build 161; x-drafts 16; x-evidence 5. Each team drains its own folders; grep sibling repos for stems before archiving (dangling-check-by-stem).")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_2 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 2u32, "2026-10-31T12:53Z", "main", "10-31 08:53 main, main's share DONE except the window-6 set: compiler-installs (124 files, install backups) MOVED to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin\\compiler-installs (older install notes' undo paths under C:\\home\\data\\compiler-installs now live there); runner-archive-2026-10-29/-30 (old spiral.exe runners) MOVED to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin\\runner-archive\\<date>; undo (40 lib undo copies, 10-29/30) MOVED to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin\\lib-land-undo\\legacy-home-data-undo; derive-land and mirror-retire (one-off scripts, referenced only by backlog notes) ARCHIVED as 20261031-085210 and -085217; main-drafts' 8 finished folders ARCHIVED as 20261031-084402. Left in main-drafts: cells-window6.ps1, cells-daemon-port, headings-cleanup (window 6 reads them; move after it lands), clip-rust (LIB-MACRO-HEAL-CLIP-RUST), commit-suggestion.md (the user's commit guide). backlog-census is mixed (main's dangling census + compiler's gate scripts): next.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_3 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 3u32, "2026-10-31T12:58Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-31 08:58 fiscal: fiscal-drafts DRAINED 19 -> 7 folders today. ARCHIVED (scratch-archive.ps1, dry-run first, 0 verify failures, junctions recorded and not followed; corpus checked intact after): 20261031-054740 (boxgate2-5, boxgate7, boxgate8: 9816 files), 20261031-055122 (dian-pred, dian-ns, generated-sync: 308), 20261031-085551 (archive, dian-lib, dian-xpath, dian-xslt, boxgate6, boxgate11, lib-programs, land-1029, cells-toml, e3live, e3live-budget, e3live-dian: 2017; the e3live layers are stale against today's generator, so the edition-3 round regenerates from the tree instead of restoring them). REPO HOME: the 5 pending lib land programs moved to fiscal/lib-programs/ (xsd-stages.kit live 161D00F5 -> AE0A917F, delphi-arms.kit, xml-xpath-fidelity.kit, cells-console-delphi.kit, cells-spiral-toml-manifest.kit; hash-identical copies); the box-gate runner became fiscal/scripts/box-gate.ps1 (compiler and mix build paths default to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\fiscal-gate). LOCALAPPDATA: undo copies to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\fiscal-undo (land-1029 134 files, cells-toml undo 7 files, both verified file by file), pinned gate compiler EEBCBFF8658A to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\fiscal-gate\\compiler. LEFT, all in use: boxgate (runner, compiler, mix builds for the 3 running/queued gates), boxgate9 (Delphi module gate running), boxgate10 (lib for the queued certificates gate), delphi, xml-fidelity, xsd-stages, cells-console (sources of the pending lands); each goes when its job or land finishes. New gate roots already live under the session scratchpad, not C:\\home\\data.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_4 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 4u32, "2026-10-31T13:15Z", "kit", "2026-10-31 09:1x kit: kit-drafts DRAINED and removed. The last 13 files (0.04 GB) were classified before archiving: (a) 8 .do appliers (no-window, delete-guard-wire, dotnet-toolchain-fallback, lane-copy-swap, train-lock-holder, train-worker-slots, train5-root, train5-src) all LANDED. 'kit do --dry-run' against the live tree finds none of their anchors, and three were confirmed by their landed form: release-train.ps1's retire-then-move swap and worker-slot mutexes, and kit_os_launch/launch.spi's CREATE_NO_WINDOW flags. (b) launch-train5.ps1, closeout-train5.ps1 and train5-closeout.ps1 are superseded by the repo's kit/scripts/launch-train.ps1 and release-acceptance.ps1 (24 rows). (c) Two probe builds, kit-final-7C8DD692.exe and kit-nowindow-6E4F7AB5.exe, are regenerable and superseded by the installed E14F1F0B. Nothing needed moving into the repo, and no findings were only in these files: each applier's result is in the tree and its note is on its item. Archived with scratch-archive.ps1: a dry run (2 folders, 13 files, 0 verify failures), then -Apply as run 20261031-091339; restore with -Restore %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261031-091339\\manifest.tsv. Earlier kit-drafts runs (10-30 22:57 .. 23:36) hold the other 48 drafts that backlog notes cite (KIT-SCRATCH-WATCH n12).")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_5 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 5u32, "2026-10-31T13:31Z", "heal", "10-31 09:3x heal (git-51): removed my two empty leftovers in C:\\home\\data: heal-test (safe_restore_control scratch) and vss-shadow1-ro (a dangling directory symlink to the 10-28 VSS shadow device, which is long gone; .Delete() removed the link only, target not followed). KEPT, do not drain: rescue-2026-10-28 (543 MB) is shared recovery state and profile-mirror.ps1 reads loss-map.md from it (1 ref); moving it needs the mirror path updated too, so I left it. Not mine, left for their owners: cuda-python/e3-samples (compiler), fiscal-drafts/lib-drafts (fiscal/lib), wow-retail-11.2.7 (tibia/wow), x-* (x), node-checkout-only (node). My recovery scripts are preserved in i574n.github/scripts/wipe-recovery (WIPE-RECOVERY-TOOLKIT), so the heal scratchpad can age out normally.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_6 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 6u32, "2026-10-31T13:37Z", "x", "2026-10-31 09:37 x: x's C:\\home\\data folders DRAINED except one file. With i574n.github/scripts/scratch-archive.ps1 (dry run, then -Apply; 0 blob verify failures): (1) x-build (161 files: cells-postability, a stale mix _build of 10-30, 138 .beam; no process named it) + x-evidence (5 files: zwsp_error_column, the repro WIPE-REDO-LEDGER n50 describes in full; verify31-net-clone, the failing net.rs and net.spi RUST-HOST-MOVE-ONLY n1 cites by hash) -> %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261031-093648 (1 link recorded, not followed). (2) x-drafts' held and finished folders (archive = the 10-30 .py/.txt retirees; g4, jsondyn, gleam-units = X-HAND-UNITS' held drafts, their resume path noted there; s5b = done) -> kit\\archive\\20261031-093702. Earlier today: 20 landed/superseded x-drafts folders -> 20261031-060539, -061426, -082550 (SIM-IN-SPIRAL n146-n147). LEFT: x-drafts\\launchers\\launch-x-verify33.ps1, until X-NODE-VERIFY-SCRIPT's replacement (i574n.github/scripts/x-node-verify.ps1) has run one verify; then archived and x-drafts removed. Restore any: scratch-archive.ps1 -Restore <archive>\\manifest.tsv -RestoreTo <dir>.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_7 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 7u32, "2026-10-31T13:44Z", "compiler", "10-31 10-31 09:44 compiler: compiler's share DRAINED (8 folders gone from C:\\home\\data). REPO HOME (apps/compiler/packs, uncommitted, all parse): predict-residuals.ps1 (was backlog-census\\pack9-predict.ps1; -Candidate now required, writes %LOCALAPPDATA%\\spiral-bin-candidates\\<pack>\\predict\\predict.json instead of .tsv/.txt files in C:\\home\\data); lib-gate-dll.ps1 (lib_gate path now relative to the repo); delphi-heaptrc.ps1 (derives its list = every sample dir with a main.pas, which was exactly the 419-line delphi-samples.txt; work dir in TEMP; smoke arithmetic_branch -UseCommitted: built, 0 unfreed). Also packs/review-candidate.ps1 lost its BelowNormal line (the starvation trap that VOIDed PACK-9's first predict). NOT moved: box-p3-abba.ps1 (packs/measure-arms.ps1 covers alternating arms; its two .py helpers are recorded on HOPACSOTA-P3 n58 for a PowerShell port). ARCHIVED (scratch-archive.ps1, dry-run first, 0 blob verify failures): 20261031-094304 = backlog-census, cuda-python, e3-samples, pack7-review, pack8-drafts, pack8-review, samples-6b-snapshot-2026-10-29, rescue-2026-10-31 (2,735 files). Restore: scratch-archive.ps1 -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261031-094304\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <dir> [-Only <folder>]. Dangling check: no code in spiral/apps, kit or i574n.github/scripts names those folders; the script stems appear only in backlog notes. Findings from those folders were already backlog notes (the n-*.txt files were note drafts). backlog-census\\user-checklist-1030.md (the user's 10-30 checklist) is in that archive; its content is the BACKLOG-DANGLING-1030 census. Left for their owners: node-checkout-only-2026-10-29-extract + .zip, everything else.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_8 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 8u32, "2026-10-31T14:19Z", "tibia-lane", "10-31 10:1x tibia: tibia/wow share DRAINED. wow-retail-11.2.7 was the user's WoW _retail_ addons and WTF backup (retail-interface-wtf.tar, 656 MB). main took it on 10-25 before WoW Data was removed from the laptop (REMOTE-LAPTOP-LANE n3, EOIE-REMOTE-EXECUTOR n1). That note's \"verify by entry count\" had no recorded result; done now: tar -tf exits 0 with 15,809 entries (15,576 Interface/AddOns, 223 WTF/Account, 7 WTF/SavedVariables, WTF/Config.wtf), file hash 51284381DED415F4. ARCHIVED with scratch-archive.ps1 (dry run first: 1 folder, 1 file, 0 verify failures), then -Apply as 20261031-101555 (blobs.zip 0.166 GB). The folder is removed. RESTORE for the WoW work: scratch-archive.ps1 -Restore '%LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\archive\\20261031-101555\\manifest.tsv' -RestoreTo <dir>. The dry run also left an identical archive, 20261031-101325. Stem check: wow-retail appears only in backlog notes, never in code. tibia owns nothing else in C:\\home\\data. tibia's stage copies inside rescue-2026-10-28 stay with that shared recovery folder (heal n: profile-mirror.ps1 reads its loss-map.md).")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_9 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 9u32, "2026-10-31T18:00Z", "main", "10-31 14:00 main recount: C:\\home\\data is down from 27 folders to 6. Drained since 08:4x: backlog-census, compiler-installs, cuda-python, derive-land, e3-samples, heal-test, kit-drafts, mirror-retire, pack7-review, pack8-drafts, pack8-review, rescue-2026-10-31, runner-archive x2, samples-6b-snapshot, undo, vss-shadow1-ro, wow-retail-11.2.7, x-build, x-evidence. LEFT: fiscal-drafts (10,308 files, active today 09:44), lib-drafts (5,357, last write 10-29, mixed lanes, unowned), rescue-2026-10-28 (25,915, healing/resilience), node-checkout-only-2026-10-29-extract (326), x-drafts (1), main-drafts (main: Cells window 6 landed, so its machinery is archived as 20261031-140008, 55 files incl. the undo copy; left: session-1030\\clip-rust for LIB-MACRO-HEAL-CLIP-RUST and commit-suggestion.md, the user's commit guide).")
