inl note_of_fiscal_typefeatureset_metrics_19 () = Note ("FISCAL-TYPEFEATURESET-METRICS", 19u32, "2026-11-06T00:47Z", "fiscal", "11-05 20:4x local fiscal: GRANULAR drafts LANDED in fiscal src, in place and unstaged: generator.spi 6ADC38CB -> 3B3D0A0E, families.spi 8F72669F -> 684AAFF5 (backups generator/families.before-granular2-* in the session scratchpad). Proof: the box full-corpus body run of the pair passed all 25 generator bodies (compile 0, ParserErrors 0, rustc 0, run 0 in 187 s; corpus 1292 unchanged), and the whole-family regen is byte-identical to the live pair (166 files, 0 differing). After placing: format --check 0 for both files, package --check 0. GRANULAR code overages: generator 6 -> 0, families 4 -> 2 (ubl_document_2_1 575, hacienda_document 471 left). The earlier VOID was the subset corpus in the stage, not the code. The node reports-gate2 (queued on laptop) gates the pre-split pair 6ADC38CB/8F72669F; the output is byte-identical, so it covers this text too.")
inl fiscal_granular_280 () = Task ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", "fiscal src: every top-level definition fits 280 weighted characters plus its header (83 of 169 over today; top five split first)", Story, P2, D4, 80u32, Active, "FISCAL-EDITION3-ROUND", "team:fiscal,fiscal,granular,style", "current", "current")
