inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_8 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 8u32, "2026-11-03T21:16Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-03 17:16 fiscal: today's NEW fiscal modules measured (proxy: characters per top-level definition without indentation, tests excluded) and the worst fixed in place, output-identical: reports.spi 'rendered' 947 -> split into section + tests_section / files_section / bench_section / examples_section (each under the bar; inl, so the generated Rust inlines them back); a vultr render of the regen7 TSVs is BYTE-IDENTICAL before and after (2,025 bytes, fresh binary). document.spi manual_canon 355 and receipt_view 387 built the same 8-field record twice -> one canon_record constructor, both now one-liners (reports C89C262F, document 249C56E6; checks, negatives and Rust runs green; p2p re-checked). Still over the proxy bar among new code: two declarations (term_value 7 cases, purchase 7 states; not split, one concept each), match_invoice 400, invoice_journal 434, status_counts 450, stamp 380. families.spi's big blocks are the moved family data (existing debt, this item's generator scope).")
