inl note_of_granular_stats_1 () = Note ("GRANULAR-STATS", 1u32, "2026-11-01T04:40Z", "main", "main 00:4x: GRANULAR-LINT (kit, 85%) already classifies host macros by GRANULAR-HEAL rule; this item makes its output a per-round metric and adds the other columns. First target the user named: lib's process execute_with_options Rust path (the pre-vibecode granular version was rewritten as a Rust block inside a macro). Find the oldest granular version in git history of lib/spiral/runtime.spi and process.spi and compare host-macro bytes then and now. Cell-budget counts per repo come from tonight's census (main scratchpad budget-census.txt).")
