inl note_of_direction_1031_6 () = Note ("DIRECTION-1031", 6u32, "2026-11-04T16:53Z", "main", "11-04 12:5x main ROLLUP (mean child progress 34.4%, was 32.5): CHECK-SILENT-DROP 100 Done; REPO-HYGIENE-LICENSES 100 Done; NAMING-LEXICON-RATCHET 45 (core name_lexicon.spi proven 5/5 on the node and handed to kit, lib token recount 55 banned-token definitions with a host-mirror/real-rename classification, n12-n13); DIALECT-IDENTITY 30; SINGLE-SPI-EXTENSION, SPELLING-PROFILES, LIB-LAYERS 0 Planned. BRZOZOWSKI-PRODUCT reads 0 but understates: its D3 certificate DoD has evidence in i574n/regex (closure/partition/normal/dfa checks with forged negatives, laws, lazy engines, typed 16-state cores, agreement incl. a C target), all unstaged until the user's push; its progress field waits on that push and its owner, so the mean is a floor. Today's CIC work (kernel inductives/K/conversion/literals Done or Active, Lean oracle 269/269) feeds the Lean-checked translation-validation milestone of that product.")
