inl note_of_diamond_s5_1 () = Note ("DIAMOND-S5", 1u32, "2026-11-01T13:06Z", "kit", "11-01 09:0x kit, slice of CODEBASE-DIAMOND (user 09:0x). DoD: a lib sample saga (3 steps) where omitting a compensation is a compile error (compile-fail test) and a replay test kills the process after step 2 and shows compensations 2 and 1 run exactly once from the iggy log; the gauge records that obligation as Proven. NEXT STEP: saga GADT in a new lib module (lib/spiral/saga.spi) over iggy events. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: saga_step :: action a * compensation a -> saga_step a (paired by construction); saga as an indexed sequence (GADT over completed steps) so compensation order is derived, not written; events reuse lib iggy's union.")
inl diamond_s6 () = Task ("DIAMOND-S6", "Fiscal calibration: XSD construct coverage with a finite denominator (team fiscal)", TaskKind, P1, D3, 100u32, Done, "DIAMOND-S1", "kit,team:kit,gauge,typefeatureset,fiscal,team:fiscal", "current", "current")
