inl note_of_x_sota_model_78 () = Note ("X-SOTA-MODEL", 78u32, "2026-11-05T05:41Z", "x", "2026-11-05 01:41 x: x-next7b RED (job-1793852448004, node, exit 8, 4207 s). PASSED: sim accept (only sim-stress.world.json changed, inside the pre-registered allowance), sim and client builds, e2e, line gate, postability census 80/80 with equality SAME, sim_progress notebook 2/2. FAILED: date_time.spi notebook 45/46: timestamp_guid_from_timestamp on the LUA target. The first x-next7 run had date_time 46/46 (draft 5ACE9C13DD10, before the heading strip). Two variables changed: (1) the draft is now ECE2A9DD6806 (17 heading lines stripped); (2) the node's installed core changed MID-RUN from 21F39A40A549E6E6 to 15FD51D755DD3120 (a pack was installed on the node during the run). NOT landed. Next: a control isolating the two (stripped vs unstripped date_time under the same compiler) before deciding.")
inl note_of_x_sota_model_79 () = Note ("X-SOTA-MODEL", 79u32, "2026-11-05T05:54Z", "x", "2026-11-05 01:54 x: x-next8 LAUNCHED on the node (job-1793858062706, core 15FD51D755DD3120 = pack38, 4 h limit, waiter on). It does not depend on x-next7: its bases (sim_serve BCD5D21D595B, lib erlang_tcp D5F79511AABB, erlang_http_server DCB208E5EA4F) are all live after x-next6, so it uses the idle node while the x-next7 date_time question is settled. Carries LIB-ERLANG-RAW-TCP: sim_serve E81668CFA086 + lib erlang_tcp 6BB3728125A5 (raw sockets plus listen_raw_local_on, comment headings stripped). Main asked to hold node compiler swaps until it ends. The compiler lane confirms no Lua codegen change between pack36 and pack38, which makes x-next7b's date_time Lua red most likely the heading strip; a box control is running. PENDING.")
inl note_of_x_sota_model_80 () = Note ("X-SOTA-MODEL", 80u32, "2026-11-05T06:02Z", "x", "2026-11-05 02:00 x: x-next8 (job-1793858062706) FAILED in 143 s, and not on its own change: the live lib reflection.spi (a peer's change) now uses the pack39 UnionCaseName op, and the node core is pack38, so the sim build fails in reflection.spi. Asked main for the node swap to pack39+; x-next8 relaunches after it. Nothing landed.")
