inl note_of_home_stray_folders_1 () = Note ("HOME-STRAY-FOLDERS", 1u32, "2026-11-01T17:13Z", "main", "main 13:2x: found in the 00:26 coverage pass (no item existed). Sizes so far: ccmr-box 145 MB/425 files, p2-cond3 61 MB, the bin/obj/results trio 46 MB each, ccmr-alt/land 14 MB. DoD: Get-ChildItem C:\\home -Directory lists only git, data, alias, tmp plus caches each named in a kit-checked list with its owner; every moved folder is archived first (scratch-archive.ps1, archive-never-delete), and its owner lane confirmed it holds no unlanded work. Next: ask compiler about ccmr-*/g3a-*/p2-cond3, resilience about recovery and remote-queue. Typefeatureset: the allowed-folder list is a closed union (HomeDir = Git | Data | Cache of owner) in kit, not a string list.")
