inl note_of_lib_fixed_views_1 () = Note ("LIB-FIXED-VIEWS", 1u32, "2026-11-01T20:03Z", "tibia-lane", "11-01 16:1x tibia: DoD: lib module with the containers and both prototypes, c/rust/lua tests plus a compile-fail test (mapped over a non-instance), node gate with a negative mutant (one mapped instance swaps two slots), wgsl on the box; tibia's 2 importers switched with the full node build green. Next step: draft from src/views.spi lines 5-55, minus policy-specific decide_all/observed, which stay in tibia.")
inl note_of_lib_fixed_views_2 () = Note ("LIB-FIXED-VIEWS", 2u32, "2026-11-01T22:56Z", "tibia-lane", "11-01 18:4x tibia: LANDED 18:43 (lib fixed_views.spi 032E9DD3172D, with case_labels and wire; close: 14 signatures unchanged, spiral.spi compiles, document_test 22, type_probe PASS with the fails-test listed as skipped). GATE (Vultr Linux mirror /home/remote/tibia-libgate; the node's runs were void, see LIB-WIRE-CHECKSUMS): positive 5/5 passed on c/rust/lua, 0 type errors, lanes_on_gpu wgsl unsupported there; negative (trio instance swaps two slots) CAUGHT, only a_trio_maps_like_the_other_views failed. TIBIA HALF (unstaged): hunting_pack 30 and pack_sim 1 'views::' sites -> 'fixed_views::'; tibia src/views.spi keeps only the policy part (decide_all, observed, 4 policy tests) over ':< fixed_views', and its 4 generic tests moved to lib. Two hunting_pack definitions went over budget from the longer prefix: fixed with an entry_trio alias and a shorter parameter name. Next: box wgsl run, then the tibia consumer build on the node.")
inl note_of_lib_fixed_views_3 () = Note ("LIB-FIXED-VIEWS", 3u32, "2026-11-01T23:23Z", "tibia-lane", "11-01 19:2x tibia: box wgsl lanes_on_gpu passed 1/1 against the live lib. The tibia half is in the user's commit 2aa39c6, whose CI run 41359244876 went RED on both OS, but only at the cell budget: hunting_pack:607 (282) and :1589 (273) grew from the longer fixed_views:: prefix. Both are fixed unstaged (entry_trio alias, shorter parameter; local budget 0 findings). A scoped node consumer build of the touched files (job-1793574933546) is running. DONE when the user's next push goes green.")
inl note_of_lib_fixed_views_4 () = Note ("LIB-FIXED-VIEWS", 4u32, "2026-11-02T01:18Z", "tibia-lane", "11-01 21:2x tibia, DONE. tibia CI run 41366570407 on the user's commit 1f40e7d (which includes 2aa39c6's views migration plus the hunting_pack budget fix): 53 of 57 test files green on both OS, including hunting_pack, pack_sim and views (decide_all/observed policy tests over lib fixed_views). The 4 red files are unrelated to views and fixed unstaged: results/arena_rows (a combinator named 'then', a keyword), hit_grid and table_rows (same package), and offscreen (the '^^' after global binding). Lib side: landed 18:43, gated on Vultr with the mutant caught, wgsl green on the box.")
