inl note_of_regex_lean_validation_1 () = Note ("REGEX-LEAN-VALIDATION", 1u32, "2026-11-01T20:26Z", "regex", "regex 16:4x. DEFERRED from the share (GATE 2). DOD: a certificate file format + an independent in-repo checker first; then lake build green, the Lean checker accepts 100% of test-set DFAs and rejects 100% of injected mutations, derivative/nullability theorems outside the trusted base (cut after 3 weeks to checker + certificate, TCB = Lean kernel); up-to-congruence (Bonchi-Pous) NFA equivalence; Mathlib-style names (minimal_of_nerode_classes). Until done the README says \"certified\", not \"proved\". NEXT STEP: none until REGEX-NERODE certificates exist. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: certificates exported from the same typed values the checker builds; Lean backend for the checker where it helps. FIELDS: estimate 2400, load medium, assignee agent.")
