inl note_of_lib_move_cli_prelude_1 () = Note ("LIB-MOVE-CLI-PRELUDE", 1u32, "2026-11-01T22:53Z", "main", "11-01 19:0x main (lib-reshape generic-code sweep). SITES (kit src/<pkg>/<file>:line, read in place). (A) argv, offset 1 (optionm'.default_value \"\" (env.try_command_line_argument (index - 1i32))): kit_guide/guide.spi:3, kit_memory_model/model.spi:3, kit_resume/resume.spi:4, agile_memory_links/links.spi:4, kit_process_table/host.spi:1, kit_standards/standards.spi:5, kit_grep_query/grep.spi:26, kit_read_query/read.spi:8, kit_style_census/census.spi:4, kit_adoption/run.spi:6, kit_table_logs/logs.spi:4, kit_do/host.spi:1, kit_repo_state/repo.spi:53, kit_table_query/table.spi:7, kit_experiments/ledger_host.spi:6. Offset 0: kit_table_sequence_args/args.spi:16, kit_k3s/k3s.spi:5, kit_ci_parity/parity.spi:46, kit_bindings/bindings.spi:12, kit_lint_macros/lint.spi:100, kit_os_launch/run.spi:5, kit_crate_gate/gate.spi:61, kit_mirror/check.spi:4, kit_env_pins/check.spi:4, kit_job_rechain/rechain.spi:8. Raw std::env::args().nth host macros: kit_dev_model/host.spi:1, kit_predicate_lift/host.spi:1, kit_machine_watch/run.spi:6, workspace_primitives/rooted.spi:1 proxy_argument (offset 2). Offset 2 via rust_std_env/model.spi:31 argument_owned (+ argument_at :9, argument_after_flag :6, argument_flag_present :1, argument_count_after :4, args_len_is :12, argument_len :15, argument_byte :19, argument_equals :24): wrapped again as argument_owned in 20 packages (agile_planning_migration:11, agile_planning_rollup:11, agile_task_notes:12, agile_task_rename:12, agile_title_notes:12, agile_todo_roots/roots_edit:11, agile_todo_scan:27, kit_agile_list_args/args:3, kit_agile_next_args/args:11, kit_agile_mutation/agile_mutation:39, kit_agile_routes/routes:11, agile_todo_record/record:12, agile_task_inspection:11, agile_planning_revision:9, agile_backlog_scaffold:11, agile_note_edit:12, agile_task_listing:11, agile_task_views/views:9, agile_task_creation:13, patch_mutation_contract/model:48, agile_task_revision:12). argument_count copies: 8 x 'user - 1' (agile_planning_migration:12 and the 7 agile packages above at the next line), 2 x 'host - 2' (kit_agile_list_args/args:4, kit_agile_next_args/args:12), 11 x '+ 1' (kit_grep_query/grep:27, kit_read_query/read:9, agile_memory_links/links:5, kit_standards/standards:6, kit_jobs/host:7, kit_table_query/table:8, kit_repo_state/repo:54, kit_do/host:2, kit_process_table/host:2, kit_adoption/run:7, kit_table_logs/logs:5). (B) console: alias stdout_line/stderr_line = console.write_line/write_error_line in ~20 packages (e.g. kit_do_git_host/host:10, kit_do_lab/host:1, kit_jobs/host:76-78, kit_do/host:5, kit_guide/guide:9-10, kit_standards/standards:7-8, kit_table_query/cells:50-51, kit_do_read/host:10, kit_do_tables/host:3, kit_do_jobs/host:9, kit_do_process/host:9, kit_do_write_host/host:12, kit_resume/resume:8-9, kit_repo_state/repo:56, kit_memory_model/model:7-8); raw println host macros kit_do_edit/host:9, kit_do_facts/host:5; exit-coded writers workspace_primitives/console.spi:1,3,5 and kit_evidence/evidence.spi:31,35. (C) parse-or-zero: decimal_u64 kit_grep_query/grep:29, kit_jobs/host:12, kit_table_query/query:57, kit_read_query/read:11, kit_adoption/run:8, kit_machine_watch/run:10; decimal_of kit_do_jobs/run:36, kit_machine_windows/window_model:128, kit_process_table/model:29, kit_do_process/host:41, kit_do_read/host:9, trimmed kit_machine_health/health:16, kit_machine_sample/sample:153, host macros kit_do_edit/decode:6, kit_do_program/program:44. (D) own pid: kit_job_host/host_run:12, kit_job_slot/slot:43, kit_process_table/host:3 and x apps/client/oauth1.spi:25 process_id, all = lib env.spi:318 process_id. (E) tibia apps/offscreen/offscreen.spi:327 arguments_from = lib env.spi:254 arguments_from. LIB TARGETS: env, console, convert (existing). TYPED SHAPE: one argv view with phantom bases, :! argv 'base, bases :! program_args (offset 0) / :! verb_args (1) / :! route_args (2), argv_of_program () : argv program_args, argv_after_verb (), argv_after_route (); argv_at (a : argv 'b) (i : i32) : string (total, \"\" past the end), argv_count (a), argv_flag (a) (flag) : bool, argv_after_flag (a) (flag) : string. Callers can no longer mix offsets because the base is in the type. console: write_line_checked / write_error_line_checked : string -> exit_code with :! exit_code = i32 (0 written, 2 failed; covers broken pipes), the plain write_line stays. convert: decimal_or (fallback : u64) (text : string) : u64 that trims, one concept, no per-type aliases. Bloat guard (WORKSPACE-PRIMITIVES-LIB n20): no per-package aliases remain; packages call env/console/convert directly. DoD: (1) lib definitions with :# blocks (offset arithmetic per base, past-end index, flag lookup, a closed-stdout write returns 2, decimal_or on ' 12 ', 'x', '') passing in Cells on rust and fsharp (gleam where env has arms); (2) every site above switched and the rust_std_env argument family deleted, proven by kit's touched notebooks + crate regen with byte-identical CLI outputs on a fixture argv, x's client build, tibia's offscreen build; (3) package-local copies deleted. Overlap: EOIE-HEAL-BOUNDARY owns rust_std_env as a package; this item supplies the lib target.")
