inl note_of_import_types_delete_2 () = Note ("IMPORT-TYPES-DELETE", 2u32, "2026-11-02T10:53Z", "compiler", "11-02 06:55 compiler: GROOM. SITES (live tree, 5 places in 4 files): spiral_compiler.fs importedTypeUnits 12459-12469 plus its fallback reads in codegenRust 14537-14542 and codegenGleam 18574-18579; host tmp/compiler/host/Program.fs applyEntryImports 1265-1279 (cited Program.fs:1221-1235 had moved); apps/cells/spi/directives.spi:69 (`\"--import-types\" :: _ :: rest`; :53 is positive_timeout) and its test directives_test.exs:55-57. BLOCKER outside compiler: kit still GENERATES the header, at C:\\home\\git\\kit\\src\\kit_bindings_model\\model.spi:157 (`\"///- --import-types \" ++# crate ...`) and its test :197. kit's generator must move to link: before deletion, or kit's crates lose their imports. ORDER: second cut (n9 unit graph), then kit rerun green (scan <= 812 / merge <= 815, no E0432), then kit drops the generator, then this deletion in one pack. Cells' directive skip is x's/main's file; it can keep reading past the flag for one pack so old notebooks don't break.")
