inl note_of_regex_crate_units_1 () = Note ("REGEX-CRATE-UNITS", 1u32, "2026-11-02T11:15Z", "regex", "regex 07:3x DOD: kit crate gate <regex root> --enforce --limit 1000 green with >= 15% headroom; build.ps1's 1000-line warning turned back into a throw; CI green on both OSes; bench output and counts unchanged (same report rows). STEPS (kit n11 on REGEX-BENCH-PAGE): :~ for the order_re group, workload_report/facts_of HTML builders and every multi-use helper; a types-only model package shared as is; link: units per engine family with typed single-argument entries (no --import-types, deleted by IMPORT-TYPES-DELETE); a compiler fixture proving a recursive re with a char_set normal GADT payload crosses a unit (LINKED-UNITS-MONOMORPHIC-RULE) before relying on it. NEXT STEP: the :~ pass and a regen measurement on the node (bench-probe script in drafts\\regex\\REGEX-BENCH-PAGE). TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: unit entries take and return the typed unions; no i32 codes across units.")
inl regex_codegen_patches () = Task ("REGEX-CODEGEN-PATCHES", "Compiler backend patches driven by the regex hot loop: profile generated Rust/C, patch codegenRust/CodegenC (state dispatch, Rc clones, bounds checks, closures) with in-job A/A + A/B, suite oracle unchanged", Story, P1, D7, 0u32, Planned, "REGEX-DFA-TABLE", "regex,automata,benchmark,compiler,team:compiler,team:main,main", "current", "current")
