inl note_of_regex_prefilter_1 () = Note ("REGEX-PREFILTER", 1u32, "2026-11-02T11:28Z", "regex", "regex 07:5x FILED from the share re-read (contradiction (a): M5 was parked behind GATE 1). Source C §B.2 M5, §A.1 #3 (\"I did not find this in any engine\"). DOD: literal extraction from re; prefilter arms chosen per pattern; a certificate that every match contains one of the literals, checked by inclusion L(r) <= L(S*.(lit1|...|litn).S*) through the product/inclusion machinery; geomean <= 1.5x rust/regex on the intersection and literals <= 1.2x; FREEZE if < 30% gain over the plain DFA. NEXT STEP: literal extraction + inclusion check as a Cells test, then a memchr arm. TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: a prefilter value is only constructible with its necessity certificate (certified_prefilter built by the checker).")
inl note_of_regex_prefilter_2 () = Note ("REGEX-PREFILTER", 2u32, "2026-11-02T11:28Z", "regex", "regex 07:5x SOURCE: share re-read by subagent a7601c1fd3d1a599f, verbatim at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\REGEX-SOTA\\sota-reread-20261102.md (C = artifact cccab1fd, E = 4edd442c, N = d05f9cdd, S = 76f3f8a7). ADDITION 12 (verbatim): 12. NEW REGEX-PREFILTER: prefilters as their own item (M5), split out of AOT-TARGETS because M5 is GATE 1's 2-4x branch. memchr/memchr2/memchr3, rare byte, and a Teddy-style literal set via memchr/aho-corasick in the generated code; a necessity certificate L ⊆ Σ*·Lits·Σ*. DoD: geomean <= 1.5x rust/regex on the intersection, and the literal benchmarks <= 1.2x (both thresholds missing from the backlog today). Cut: freeze if the gain over M4 is under 30%. Timebox 2 weeks. Source: C §B.2 M5.")
