inl note_of_regex_mask_1 () = Note ("REGEX-MASK", 1u32, "2026-11-02T11:29Z", "regex", "regex 07:5x FILED (DIRECTION-1031 candidate nerode-mask). SOURCE: share re-read (subagent a7601c1fd3d1a599f), verbatim at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\REGEX-SOTA\\sota-reread-20261102.md; C = artifact cccab1fd. VERBATIM: 17. NEW REGEX-MASK: certified masks for constrained decoding. Start after the Lean gate; timebox 8 weeks. DoD: 0 false rejects and 0 false accepts on the non-recursive regex/JSON-schema subset of JSONSchemaBench; p50 <= llguidance and p99 <= 2x llguidance, same tokenizer, same machine; a certificate for every mask. Cut: if the completeness certificate takes over 1 s per grammar at a 128k vocabulary, publish soundness only. Source: C §F.2, §E(ii). Links: TYPED-TRANSFORMER-LAB (cccab1fd: the llama becomes a consumer of the mask in an end-to-end structured-output demo). TYPEFEATURESET PLAN: product of the character automaton with a token trie as a typed product; a mask value constructible only with its soundness certificate.")
