inl x_dumps_spiral_rewrite () = Task ("X-DUMPS-SPIRAL-REWRITE", "x-dumps rewrite in Spiral as a generic x app (GROOMED, start gated: only after every test account (fc1943s, i574n, stewshka, juhondacivic, geygey_hadid) finishes its archive + X + context + media pass): port xarchive (hand-written Rust, 9 files) to typed-units/1 as apps/archive in the x repo (model / boundary / harvest / history / bin), knowing no account, team or path; byte-identical outputs vs the Rust run on the frozen /data/x cache are the acceptance test; stage progress + stage-done events on iggy (lib/spiral iggy.spi) so heartbeats follow events instead of ssh-polling logs; k3s manifests from kit k3s render; then retire C:\\home\\git\\xarchive", Feature, P1, D6, 0u32, Planned, "X-DUMPS,TEMPLATE-TYPED-UNITS-1", "team:x-dumps,x-dumps,spiral,iggy,k3s", "current", "current")
