inl note_of_cells_port_targets_20 () = Note ("CELLS-PORT-TARGETS", 20u32, "2026-11-03T02:09Z", "x", "2026-11-02 22:09 x: compiler's CELLS-TYPED-TARGETS edits read and kept (peer heads-up). targets.spi C9FF077924D0 (21:55: target_of returns option target, no UnknownTarget) is the exact base of the x-cells-th1 draft, and its land guard pins that hash. notebook.ex CAC37061E0E0 (21:39: with_builders rescues an unknown backend as :builder_error) and notebook_targets_test.exs 2ABBFF79E520 aren't touched by any x draft, and x-cells-pbb1 ran with them in both A and B. PascalTarget is noted as x's to add, as part of this item's builder/target model. builders.spi's ForDelphi already maps 'delphi' and 'pascal', so a target-side Pascal case would sit next to DelphiTarget.")
