inl note_of_cic_mega_absorb_1 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ABSORB", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:20Z", "regex", "regex 08:2x SOURCE: read-only research by subagent add9e665535617d64 (11-02), copy at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\GROOM-1102\\cic-sps-report.md. LEGACY: main.spi 9,309 lines, 499 :=, 104 unions, 74 nominals, 133 GADT cases, 295 existential sites, 77 *_terminal claims, 0 prototypes, 0 test blocks; core corrected_cic_term ctx sort (SortZero, BoundHere/There, Constant, Definition, Lambda, Pi, DependentLambda/DependentApplication/Application/Let with an existential domain) plus strict positivity, verified eliminators and iota, contextual beta and subject reduction, renaming/lifting laws, two-cell swap, one-binder substitution, Bool-indexed dependent results, structural defeq, a conversion-constraint solver, meta assignment and WHNF; its own open list: kernel unification, general Pi in the main AST, dependent substitution, confluence and strong normalization. DOD: every row ABSORBED / PARTIAL with a landing / dropped with a reason, counts and citations. SHARED TYPEFEATURESET RULE: the runtime term is a closed `:| ^ term` with a de Bruijn depth as a runtime u32 (no growing phantom, so no wait on GADT-JOIN-POINT-GROWING-INDEX); scope typestate is a two-value phantom (loose | closed, constant indices compile today); judgements are GADT-indexed certificates (cert has_type | cert defeq | cert whnf) with refusals as a reason union; prototypes for environment and reduction-strategy dispatch (forall prototype lists explicit, dispatch once at the boundary); existentials only for the static fixture/corpus registry; names are nominals, strings only at the Lean printer boundary. TEMPLATE: regex repo (src notebooks with `///- --package . --timeout N`, a `:# <file> static =` prelude, `///> rust`/`///> gleam`/`///> lean` pinned tests with one-line _assert_eq bodies, :~ join points for multi-use helpers, build.ps1 reading the spiral-tests total line, the Windows event-log crash reader, the 1000-line gate, cell budget 272) and kit's link: units for crate splits (not --import-types, deleted by IMPORT-TYPES-DELETE).")
inl note_of_cic_mega_absorb_2 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ABSORB", 2u32, "2026-11-04T11:03Z", "main", "11-04 07:1x main COVERAGE MAP of the legacy sample's negative families (mega_lean_cic_bottom_up_kernel/main.spi: 3 GADT families, 5 rejected-program builders) onto the apps/kernel tests and the Lean oracle. CicStrictPositivityRejected -> kernel 'not strictly positive' tests (single family and mutual cross-family) plus oracle Bad negative, Lean-confirmed. CicInductiveDeclarationRejected (wrapper) -> admit_inductive/admit_mutual refusals NotPositive, NotConstructorOf, NotAType. The 5 conversion-constraint rejections (pi, application, dependent application, substituted codomain) -> oracle refusals Lean confirms: Type vs (P : Prop) -> P, (fun x => x) T, @K.id.{0} T t, Eq mismatches including the lift reduction to K.t2. CicNoRecursiveOccurrenceRejected is a legacy schema artifact: Lean admits non-recursive families, so the kernel must not refuse them. Positive features: everything on the legacy list has a kernel test except meta assignment and unification, which belong to an elaborator, not a kernel. SUBJECT REDUCTION is now a law test (beta, delta and iota redexes keep their type after whnf), gating next. NEXT for parity: archive the sample under CIC-MEGA-ARCHIVE (user go).")
inl note_of_cic_mega_absorb_3 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ABSORB", 3u32, "2026-11-05T04:55Z", "main", "11-05 00:55 main ABSORPTION MAP, the 77 *_terminal claims of mega_lean_cic_bottom_up_kernel/main.spi vs apps/kernel (REGEX-LEGACY-ABSORB format). VERDICT: a from-scratch locally-nameless kernel that absorbs the semantics, not the intrinsic encoding. ABSORBED 52: environment/nominal identity (primary_environment_nominal_identity, recursive_environment_membership_identity) -> env + typing constants/admission + replay of 25732 Lean decls; lifting/renaming/context extension (13: bound_there, two_cell/finite/composite/lambda/nested_binder lifting, context_extension composition/associativity/identity, explicit_renaming, renaming composition/identity/associativity) -> scope.spi + subst.spi de Bruijn laws (lift-lower identity, lifts compose, every shape round-trips); substitution (5: one_binder, function_binder, total_substitution_nested_lambda_let, bool_dependent_pi_substitution, parametric_substitution_sort_family) -> subst.spi substitution lemma + typing instantiation; dependent application/codomain (8: codomain, bool_dependent_application_program(+negation_involution), recursive_codomain_application, programmed/indexed_unary_constructor/indexed/scoped dependent application) -> typing + inductive indexed-family tests + Lean oracle; whnf spines (7: whnf_nested_let_beta, ordinary_identity_whnf, spine/let_spine/delta_spine_whnf, dependent_beta constant/bound bool) -> reduce.spi beta/zeta/delta/fuel; defeq/congruence (4: structural_defeq, exact_pi_defeq, application/dependent congruence) -> conversion.spi; iota/eliminators (3: iota_indexed_recursor_component, eliminator_program_direct_conclusion, recursive_sort_zero_canonical_contractum_shape) -> inductive.spi iota tests + replay recursors defeq to Lean's; subject reduction (raw_bool_contextual_chain_subject_reduction, contextual_identity_beta_direct_subject_reduction) -> inductive reduction_preserves_the_type_of_beta_delta_and_iota_redexes; contextual beta and body reduction (lambda/let/let_lambda body reduction, contextual_identity_beta(+program)) -> reduce + conversion under binders; surface (cic_active_corrected_kernel_surface) -> the apps/kernel package. FILLED TONIGHT (were MISSING, 13): local confluence (5: nested_identity/beta_let local diamonds(+programs), local_confluence_coverage_suite) -> NEW conversion test a_beta_zeta_diamond_joins_in_one_normal_form; context exchange (8: two_cell_swap and its 7 binder/program variants) -> NEW typing test swapping_independent_context_entries_keeps_the_type (both unstaged; gates PENDING on vultr). DROPPED with reason, 12: metavariables/unification (7: selected_typed_meta_assignment(+program), conversion_constraint_solver, unification_solver, environment_bound_selected_meta, meta_membership_identity_spine, general_meta_environment) are elaborator-level, Lean's kernel has none either; derivation algebra of the old encoding (5: contextual_identity_beta subject_reduction_program/append, derivation_append_coherence, append_associativity, append_identity) plus intrinsic_target program/append_homomorphism are proof-object composition laws with no runtime analogue. 52 + 13 + 12 = 77. The 40 negatives are mapped on CIC-TYPING n8.")
inl note_of_cic_mega_absorb_4 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ABSORB", 4u32, "2026-11-05T04:55Z", "main", "11-05 00:55 main CORRECTION to the previous note's totals (the rows are right, the sums were not): ABSORBED 50 (2 env + 13 lifting/renaming + 5 substitution + 8 dependent application + 7 whnf + 4 defeq + 3 iota + 2 subject reduction + 5 contextual beta + 1 surface), FILLED 13, DROPPED 14 (7 metavariable + 5 derivation-append + 2 intrinsic_target). 50 + 13 + 14 = 77.")
inl note_of_cic_mega_absorb_5 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ABSORB", 5u32, "2026-11-05T04:57Z", "main", "11-05 00:57 main PROVEN on vultr (run_notebook --gate, spiral head faf422c9 + the unstaged tests): conversion.spi 7/7 including a_beta_zeta_diamond_joins_in_one_normal_form (outer-beta and inner-zeta reducts of (fun x => x) (let y := a in y) both reach a and are defeq), typing.spi 10/10 including swapping_independent_context_entries_keeps_the_type (identical type under both orders of the independent entries p and q). Every row of the map is now ABSORBED, FILLED (proven) or DROPPED with a reason; the 40 negatives are on CIC-TYPING n8. DONE.")
