inl note_of_cic_mega_archive_1 () = Note ("CIC-MEGA-ARCHIVE", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:20Z", "regex", "regex 08:2x SOURCE: read-only research by subagent add9e665535617d64 (11-02), copy at %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\regex\\GROOM-1102\\cic-sps-report.md. GATE: every absorption row resolved, the new tests green on rust/gleam/lean in CI on a pushed commit. STEPS: stem dangling check across sibling repos; the compiler lane keeps chosen minimal regression samples; remove its matrix.psd1 rows (Mega list, Timeouts, Lean/AlsoTypeScript runtime_native rows, ExpectedErrors); single-flight -Accept; scratch-archive.ps1 hash-verified; MEGA-SAMPLES-TOGETHER swaps its canary to apps/kernel.")
inl cells_scaling_bench () = Task ("CELLS-SCALING-BENCH", "Benchmark dib (dotnet-repl/fsi chain) vs Cells once and for all: per-cell cost as cell count grows (1..128 cells), per phase (parse, prefix compile, codegen, native build, run), on the 3 nodes; output = the ranked list of what to fix so long runs stay fast", Story, P1, D4, 0u32, Planned, "", "team:compiler,compiler,cells,perf,bench", "current", "current")
inl planning_of_cells_scaling_bench () = Planning ("CELLS-SCALING-BENCH", Minutes 360u32, Load Medium, Assigned Agent)
inl note_of_cells_scaling_bench_1 () = Note ("CELLS-SCALING-BENCH", 1u32, "2026-11-02T12:24Z", "compiler", "11-02 08:20 compiler: filed from the user's directive (relayed by resilience 11-02): \"benchmark dib vs cells once and for all ... more cells => exponentially slower\"; it also helps define DoDs across projects. PLAN: one generated notebook family (N = 1, 2, 4 ... 128 cells, each a small typed cell over one shared prefix), run under Cells (daemon compiler, memo off and on) and under the dib path (dotnet-repl / fsi_chain, KINO-FSI-CLEANUP), with an A/A arm in the same job and wall time, CPU and RSS per phase. Fit the curve (linear vs quadratic in N). The deliverable is the ranked list of causes (e.g. each cell recompiles its whole prefix => O(N^2)). Existing tool to extend, not duplicate: apps/compiler/scripts/bench-cells-vs-matrix.ps1. Runs on the nodes, never the box.")
inl compiler_ci_aot () = Task ("COMPILER-CI-AOT", "Spiral compiler binaries built in GitHub Actions as NativeAOT with the newest .NET 11 flags, so running the compiler needs no dotnet runtime", Story, P2, D5, 0u32, Planned, "", "team:compiler,compiler,ci,aot,dotnet", "current", "current")
