inl note_of_dcolon_migration_lint_8 () = Note ("DCOLON-MIGRATION-LINT", 8u32, "2026-11-05T14:49Z", "compiler", "11-05 10:4x compiler: compiler's share, apps/compiler: census over the 40 git-tracked non-sample .spi = 329 respell-drift findings in 11 files. HEALED (unstaged) apps/compiler/spi/tokens.spi, the only real-code file: 84 -> 0 via 'format --respell' (75 lines, all '.member' -> '::member': from, length, text, triple_quotes, ...). Base F49D8C181EBB -> D4505E11CD1D; undo copy in the compiler scratchpad (dcolon\\tokens.spi.before). format --check clean. Behaviour: Cells gate of the file in mirror trees (apps/compiler/spi + a junction to the live lib), before vs after: 15 tests, 14 passed, the SAME 1 failing on both (lex_number_reads_suffixes_signs_and_fractions on rust, pre-existing). KEPT AS WRITTEN: the 245 findings in tmp/formatter/synthetic/* (4 files) and tmp/tests/families/* (4 files); those are fixtures that pin source shapes for the formatter and family tests.")
