inl note_of_physics_out_of_lib_1 () = Note ("PHYSICS-OUT-OF-LIB", 1u32, "2026-11-02T13:15Z", "main", "main 11-02: user directive relayed by resilience 08:11 (brain-dump): the user agrees physics has no users and confuses auto dependency detectors, BUT keeps it until we reach the LITERATE state (rendered notebooks with graphs/charts and cell outputs, like the old dib runner). So the order is CELLS-PLOT-EXPORT (0%) first, then move physics out (archive, never delete; dangling check by stem first). Parked decision #5 from 11-01 (\"move physics out of lib: yes\") is now answered with this order.")
