inl note_of_granular_split_process_fsharp_2 () = Note ("GRANULAR-SPLIT-PROCESS-FSHARP", 2u32, "2026-11-03T16:13Z", "main", "main 11-03 12:1x DECIDED: DELETE (rule: no consumer compiles process.spi to F#; F# only reached it through its own F#-targeted 'main' export block, polyglot's Supervisor surface, retired). Draft %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\spiral\\GRANULAR-SPLIT-PROCESS-FSHARP\\process.spi (A3BAFCF6, base C74E753F): removes execute_with_options_fsharp (213 lines), the Fsharp arm of execute_with_options, and the F#-only main export (15 lines); 1264 -> 1033 lines; the ///> fsharp split_args/split_command tests stay (they never reach the runner). Round-trip canonical + fixpoint. GATES (A/A, same machine, live vs draft): vultr live 7/15 = draft 7/15 (the same 8 Windows-program tests fail on Linux); node live 16/18 vs draft 17/18, and all 8 process-running tests PASS on Windows in both; the residual failures are 300 s cell timeouts on a loaded node (slowest cell 283 s), on different targets each run. Landing now through LAND-GATE-OFF-BOX's two-step path (node close -> box -ProvenLog), as its first real use.")
