inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_1 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 1u32, "2026-11-04T04:30Z", "x-dumps", "New xarchive `world` subcommand reads people/*/timeline.ndjson, emits one joined world.json (users ordered oldest-account-first so by_handle resolves the reused handle to the current holder; lost posts kept with lost:true + lost_reason for the render-filter; refs from kind). 2026-11-04: emitted to vultr:/data/x/joined/joined.world.json (112M, 5 users, 162542 posts), validated (304 same-second ties confirm the id tie-break matters; retweets carry no reposted ref - data limitation). x owns the HTML timeline_serve route; I heal the emitter as replay finds edges.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_2 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 2u32, "2026-11-04T05:00Z", "x-dumps", "World rebuilt post-recovery 2026-11-04: vultr:/data/x/joined/joined.world.json 163307 posts, media now objects per x spec, + joined/unrecoverable.ndjson index. Handed to x; awaiting x replay through the sim (id tie-break + handle + lost-filter slice) to surface edges. Emitter (xarchive world) is the deliverable; x owns timeline_serve route.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_3 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 3u32, "2026-11-04T05:30Z", "x-dumps", "Media backfill done 2026-11-04 05:29: 300 recovered-tweet media downloaded for fc1943s (132 pending at --max 300 cap, polish; 217 gone). World rebuilt 163307 posts WITH recovered media objects at vultr:/data/x/joined/joined.world.json. x reads fresh at replay. Minor follow-up: re-backup fc1943s/i574n media (300 new files not in the in-flight important-media backup, which already passed those dirs); re-fetchable so low priority.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_4 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 4u32, "2026-11-04T07:02Z", "x-dumps", "Battle-test edge (x scan 2026-11-04): a post id can appear under 2 accounts when both retweet the same original (id 1814831297249837420, both @fc1943s retweeted @makeuokay). Our archive carries the ORIGINAL id for retweets (no repost-own status id exists - retweets have no archived permalink; verified raw live.ndjson has no retweeted_status/separate id). RESOLUTION: not an emitter fix (synthesizing a composite id = fabrication); x keys the sim post index per (author_id,id). Emitter stays faithful (original id + kind=retweet + retweet_author = typed Repost:user_id). Rest of x scan clean: 0 malformed stamps, 0 empty non-lost text, 0 post after now.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_5 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 5u32, "2026-11-04T10:15Z", "x-dumps", "Media backfill for recovered tweets done 2026-11-04 10:13 (fc1943s --max200 + stewshka --max100): stewshka media already cached (0 new), world re-emitted unchanged (163307 posts, unrecoverable 4860, lost-fix in place). Recovery now fully complete = all reachable TEXT + available MEDIA across the 4 live accounts. World at vultr:/data/x/joined/joined.world.json ready for x replay. JOINED-WORLD emitter deliverable effectively done (held at 98 pending x replay confirming no further edges). vultr 2.9G free - holding cache-prune lever at 1G trigger.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_6 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 6u32, "2026-11-04T11:08Z", "x-dumps", "Deep edge-scan 2026-11-04 (proactive battle-test before x replay): clean across 9 checks over all 163307 posts — 0 within-account dup ids, 0 non-numeric/empty ids, 0 empty author_id, 0 empty username, 0 bad/empty refs, 0 media missing media_key/type, 0 bad created_at, 0 empty conversation_id/edit_history, max text 2009 chars. No hidden edges beyond the 3 x already handles (cross-account dup->per-author key, lost-semantics->healed, same-second->id tie-break). World is robust for the sim replay; no emitter heal needed.")
inl note_of_xdumps_joined_world_7 () = Note ("XDUMPS-JOINED-WORLD", 7u32, "2026-11-05T02:16Z", "x-dumps", "DONE 2026-11-04: joined 5-account world.json built (163307 posts, deep-scanned clean, lost-semantics healed) AND battle-tested live on the real world via the sim-timeline demo — all 5 accounts interleave newest-first (2026-10-18 -> 2012), pagination cursor, @fc1943s-by-id disambiguation, 4860 lost hidden, authorship labels (reply/repost/quote), stable port + infinite scroll (xprobe12). Validated end-to-end on localhost. Production frontend LAND rides x-next9 (route/render drafts type-check on vultr); the world + its battle-test are complete.")
